<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- NGONI BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Vahamula</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Vahamula</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vahamula</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vah</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vahamula</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Uhamula ndi chikokosa mambu ga vandu va Isilaeli pala pevamalili kuhotola kungondo ya kumulima wa Kanaani, lwavili lukumbi Vaisilaeli vakumleka Chapanga mala pamahele na Bambu Chapanga alekili lepi kuvasangula. Mala pamahele Vaisilaeli vatumbulayi kufugamila michapanga hingi na mwene Chapanga ngaavaletili vandu kuhuma kumilima yingi muni vavang'ahayi. kangi vandu vavembili na kumuwuyila Chapanga, penapo ndi Chapanga akavahagulila vachilongosi vevakemewi, “vahamula,” Muni kuvalongosa na kuvasangula kuhuma kwa vandu avo vevavang'ahayi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kawaka mweavii na uchakaka kuvya yani mweayandiki chitabu chenichi. Vandu vamahele kwa kulanda mapokelu nunuyu vasadiki kuvya mlota Samweli ndi mwayandiki, nambu tihotola kujova kuvya chitabu chenichi chayandikwi lukumbi Vaisilaeli vamali kuvya na nkosi, muni chitabu chenichi chilangisa pandu pamahele kuvya Vaisilaeli vavii lepi na nkosi, mu sula ya 17:6; 18:1; 19:1; na 21:25. Ngati vandu Vaisilaeli vahumili ku Misili mumwaka wa 1400 kwakona kuvelekewa Kilisitu, (lola ulongolelu wa chitabu cha Kuwuka kwa makokoso neju) Hinu yihotoleka mambu ga Vaamuzi gahumalili pagati ya mwaka 1300 mbaka 1050 kwakona kuvelekewa Kilisitu lukumbi Sauli peavili nkosi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavili mugati:</para>
  <para style="io">Ngondo za pamwishu pagati ya Vaisilaeli na Vakanani paamali kufwa Yoshua. Mewa sula zenizi zidindula lipazia kumanyisa chipindi cha Vaamuzi pala Chapanga peayinwili vachilongosi vevalongwisi na kuvasangula Vaisilaeli kuhuma mumawoko ga makoko vavi, musula 1 mbaka 3:6</para>
  <para style="io">Makokoso ga Vaamula ndalindali vevayinuliwi na Chapanga kuvatangatila Vaisilaeli, musula ya 3:7 mbaka 16:31</para>
  <para style="io">Mambu ga kubelelewa kwa Vaisilaeli, musula ya 17 mbaka 21.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vakuvatova Vakanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Peamali kufwa Yoshua, Vaisilaeli vamkotili Bambu Chapanga, “Likabila loki pagati yitu lelilongolela kutovana na Vakanani?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Bambu Chapanga akavayangula, “Likabila la Yuda ndi lelilongolela kuvahotola Vakanaani na kuutola mulima wavi.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Manjolinjoli va likabila la Yuda vakavajovela valongo vavi va likabila la Simeoni, “Muwungana na tete petihamba kutovana na kuutola mulima wetipewili. Na tete mewa yati tiwungana na nyenye pemwihamba kutovana na kuutola mulima wemupewa.” Ndi likabila la Simeoni vakayidakila kuhamba pamonga nawu. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Hinu, vandu va likabila la Yuda vakahamba kuzangila, na mwene Bambu Chapanga avatangatili vavahotola Vakanani na Vapelezi, vakavakoma vagosi elufu kumi kungondo kwenuko ku Bezeki. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Kwenuko kumuji wa Bezeki vamkolili nkosi Adonibezeki, vakatovana nayu na kuvahotola Vakanani na Vapelezi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Adonibezeki akatila, nambu vamjumbisi na kumkamula, vakamdumula magumba ga mmumawoko na mumagendelu. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Adonibezeki akajova, “Vankosi sabini venavadumwili magumba ga mumwoko na magendelu vanongayi masigalilu ga chakulya pahi ya meza yangu. Hinu Chapanga anilipisi ngati chanihengili.” Vampeliki ku Yelusalemu na mwene akafwila kwenuko.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu va likabila la Yuda vakuvahotola vandu va muji wa Yelusalemu na Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Kangi vandu va likabila la Yuda vavatovili vandu va muji wa Yelusalemu na kuutola muji wenuwo. Vavakomili vandu voha kwa mapanga na kuuyongomesa muji kwa motu. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Mwanakandahi manjolinjoli va likabila la Yuda vahambili kutovana na Vakanani vevatama ku milima ya vitumbi, na vangi vevatama ku mulima uyumu wa Negebu na vevavi ku mulima wa selede papipi na mbwani. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Pagenago, vakahamba kuvazangila Vakanani vevatama kumuji wa Hebuloni, kadeni muji wenuwo wakemiwi Kiliati Aliba, vakavahotola vandu va lukolo lwa Sheshai na Himani na Talimai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otinieli akuuzangila muji wa Debili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOS 15:13-19">Yosh 15:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Kuhuma kwenuko manjolinjoli va likabila la Yuda vahambili kutovana na vandu va muji wa Debili, kadeni apo muji wenuwo wakemiwi Kiliati Sefeli. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Kalebu akajova, “Mundu yoyoha mwaihotola kuvazangila na kuutola muji wa Kiliati Sefeli yati nikumpela msikana wangu Akisa avya mdala waki.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Hinu Otinieli, mwana wa Kenazi mbena vaki Kalebu, avatovili vandu va muji wenuwo, Kalebu amuwusili msikana waki Akisa muni agegewa na Otinieli. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Akisa peagegiwi na Otinieli, ligono limonga akamkulukisa Otinieli, akamjovela, “Umuyupayi dadi wangu mgunda.” Akisa akwelili panani ya punda na pahulwiki Kalebu akamkota, “Ugana nikupela kyani?” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Akamyangula, “Nipela njombi, niyupa unipela chinyepa cha manji muni mgunda wewanipelili ku Negebu ndi payumu.” Kalebu akampela chinyepa cha upandi wa kunena na kunyasi.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhotola wa vandu va likabila la Yuda na la Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Uveleku va Keni mweavili mkohanu wa Musa, valandini na vandu wa likabila la Yuda kuhuma Muji wa Mitende mewa wewakemiwi Yeliko, mbaka ku lugangatu lwa Yuda lweluvii kusini papipi na Aladi, vakatama kwenuko pamonga na vandu va Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Kangi manjolinjoli va likabila la Yuda vakalongosana na valongo vavi manjolinjoli va likabila la Simioni, na vakavatova Vakanaani vevatamayi ku Sefati. Vauyongomisi njwee muji wenuwo na kung'anamusa lihina laki na kuukemela Holima. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Manjolinjoli va likabila la Yuda mewa vatolili miji ya Gaza na mibaka yaki, na muji wa Ashilekeloni na mibaka yaki na Ekiloni na mibaka yaki yoha yeyatindili mulima wenuwo. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Bambu Chapanga avili pamonga na vandu va likabila la Yuda, na vene vaukamwili mulima wa hitumbi. Nambu vavahotwili lepi vakolonjinji va milima ya selede ndava venavo vavi na mutuka za ngondo zazihutwa na falasi zavili za lyuma ndi vahotwili lepi kuvavingisa. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Muji wa Hebuloni wagotoliwi kwa Kalebu ngati cheavalagisi Musa. Kalebu avingili lukolo ludatu lwa chiveleku cha Anaki vevavili mwenumo. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Nambu vandu va likabila la Benjamini vavavingi lepi Vayebusi vevatamayi pabomani ya Yelusalemu, mbaka lelu iyi Vayebusi vitama na vandu va likabila la Benjamini bomani ya Yelusalemu.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likabila la Efulaimu na Manase vakuvahotola vandu va Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Manjolinjoli va makabila ga Yosefu ndi Efulaimu na Manase vakwelili kuhamba kuuzangila muji wa Beseli, na Bambu Chapanga avi pamonga navu. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Vandu va makabila ga Yosefu vatumbwili hoti kuvatuma vamang'omesi vakaung'omesa muji wa Beseli. Muji wenuwo kadeni wakemiwi Luzu, <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Vamang'omesi venavo vamuweni mundu mmonga ihuma kumuji wenuwo vene vakamjovela, “Tilangisa njila yayihamba kumuji na tete yati tikukoma lepi.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Akavalangisa njila yeyihamba pabomani, ndi vakayingila na kuvakoma vandu voha vevavili mwenumo. Nambu vamulekili mundu mwenuyo na vandu va munyumba yaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Mundu mwenuyo akahamila pamulima wa Vahiti, kwenuko ajengili muji weaukemili Luzu, ndi ukemiwa chenicho mbaka lelu.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu vangavingiwa na Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Vandu va likabila la Manase vavavingili lepi vandu vevatamili kumiji ya Beti Sheani na hijiji yaki, na muji wa Taanaki na hijiji yaki na muji wa Doli na hijiji yaki na muji wa Ibuleamu na hijiji yaki na muji wa Megido pamonga na hijiji yaki. Ndava Vakanani vayendalili kutama kwenuko. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Hati Vaisilaeli pevapatili makakala vavavingili lepi Vakanani nambu vavang'ang'anisi vahenga mahengu geginonopa.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Mewawa vandu va likabila la Efulaimu vavavingili lepi Vakanani vevatama ku Gezeli, Vakanani vayendalili kutama kwenuko pamonga na vandu va Efulaimu.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Vandu va likabila la Zebuluni vavavingili lepi vakolonjinji va muji wa Kitiloni, mewa vala va muji wa Nahalali, nambu Vakanani vayendalili kutama pamonga nawu kuni vakuvang'ang'anisa kuhenga mahengu geginonopa ngati vavanda vaki.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Vandu va likabila la Asheli navene vavavingili lepi vandu va miji ya Ako na Sidoni na Helabu na Akizibu na Heliba na Afeka na Rehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Vandu va likabila la Asheli vatamili pamonga na Vakanani vakolonjinji va mulima wenuwo ndava muni vavavingili lepi.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Vandu va likabila la Nafutali vavavingili lepi vandu va muji wa Beti Shemeshi na Beti Anati, vatamili pamonga nawu. Nambu vakolonjinji va miji yeniyo yivili vang'ang'aniswi kuvahengela Vaisilaeli mahengu geginonopa.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Vaamoli vavang'ang'anisi vandu va likabila la Dani vatama kuhitumbi, vavayidakili lepi kutama pamiji ya selede. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Vaamoli vayendalili kutama mumiji yeyavili muchitumbi cha Helesi na Aiyaloni na Shaalibimu. Nambu vandu va likabila la Manase na Efulaimu vavalongwisi na kuvang'ang'anisa Vaamoli kuhenga mahengu geginonopa.<verse eid="JDG 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Mubaka wa Vaamoli wavili kasikazini ya Sela, pandu pakuholotela pepikemewa Akalabimu.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Mtumu wa kunani kwa Bambu Chapanga ku Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Mtumu wa Bambu Chapanga awukili ku Giligali akahamba ku Bokimu, akavajovela Vaisilaeli, “Nene navawusili kumulima wa Misili na kuvaleta pamulima wenavajovili vagogo vinu kuvya yati nikuvapela, najovili naha, ‘Katu yati nidenya lepi lilaganu langu na nyenye. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Na nyenye navalagizi mkotoka kukita lilaganu na vandu va mulima uwu, nambu mubomola pandu pa kuwusila luteta lwavi.’ Nambu nyenye mwaniyidakili lepi nene. Ndava kyani mwakitili lijambo lenili? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Hinu nijova, yati nikuvavinga lepi kangi vakolonjinji va mulima uwu nambu yati vakuvang'aisa, na nyenye yati mukamliwa kuyifumila michapanga yavi.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Penapo Mtumu wa Bambu Chapanga pavajovili vandu va Isilaeli malovi aga, vakakwesa lwami na kutumbula kuvemba. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Ndi vakapakemela pandu apo Bokimu. Bokimu mana yaki vandu vevivemba. Penapo vamuwusili Bambu Chapanga luteta za kutinyiswa.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifwa la Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Yoshua pamali kuvalaga Vaisilaeli, kila mmonga ahambili pandu peapewili pavyayi paki. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Vaisilaeli vamuhengili Bambu Chapanga magono goha Yoshua peavii mumi hati lukumbi peamali kufwa, na mewawa lukumbi lwoha lwevatamili vagogo vevasigalili vevagaweni matendu gakulu ga Bambu Chapanga geavahengili Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na muhengaji wa Bambu Chapanga, afwili peavili na miyaka miya yimonga na kumi. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Vamzikili pahala peagaviwi pavya paki ku Timnati Helesi, pa mulima wa vitumbi vya Efulaimu kasikazini ya chitumbi Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Kangi vandu voha va chiveleku chaki na vene vafwili, chikahumila chiveleku chingi changammanya Bambu Chapanga mewa vamanyili lepi gala gevahegili vandu va Isilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vileka kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Hinu Vaisilaeli vamkitili gahakau Bambu Chapanga, na kufugamila vimong'omong'o vya michapanga ya udesi yeyikemiwa Mabaali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Vamulekili Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa vagogo vavi mweavawusili kumulima wa Misili. Vakalanda vimong'omong'o vya michapanga vingi yeyafugamiwi na vandu vevavatindili na vakayigundamila. Ndava yeniyo vamuyomisi neju Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Vamulekili Bambu Chapanga na kuhengela vimong'omong'o vya michapanga yeyikemiwa Baali na vimong'omong'o vya chapanga mdala mweikemiwa Ashitaloti. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Hinu Bambu Chapanga akavayomela Vaisilaeli, na mwene akavaleka vahiji vavanyaga vindu vyavi. Akaleka vatoviwa na makoko vevavatindili kila upandi na vahotwili lepi kujikengelela na makoko vavi. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Kila pavahambili kutovana Bambu Chapanga avatangatili lepi, na vatoviwi ngati chila chaavahakalili na kulapa na vene vavili muungolongondi neju.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Kangi Bambu Chapanaga akavapela vaamula vevavasangwili kuwuka mumawoko ga vandu vevanyagili vindu vyavi. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Pamonga na ago Vaisilaeli vavayuwanili lepi vahamula vavi, muni vakitili ngati vakemi kwa kulanda michapanga yingi na kuyifugamila. Vayumbatiki kuleka njila yavalandayi vagogo vavi, vevayidakili malagizu ga Bambu Chapanga, nambu vene vakitili lepi chenicho. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Lukumbi lwoha Bambu peavapeli vana va Isilaeli muhamula, mwene amtangatili muhamula mwenuyo akavasangula mumawoko ga makoko vavi pamagono geatamili mhamula mwenuyo. Bambu Chapanga avahengili lipyana peayuwini chivembu chavi ndava ya mang'aiso gevakitiwi. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Nambu lukumbi lwoha muhamula peafwili vandu vawuyalili njila zavi za kadeni, vakitili uhakau neju ya vagogog vavi. vayilandili michapanga yingi vayihengili na kuyigundamila, katu valekili lepi matendu gavi gakahau na ndindani zavi. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Hinu Bambu Chapanga avayomili vandu va Vaisilaeli akajova, “Ndava muni vandu ava vadenyili lilaganu lenakitili na vagogo vavi, navene vabelili kuniyidakila, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />nene yati nikuvavinga lepi vandu va makabila gangi vala veavalekili Yoshua lukumbi lula peafwili. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Yati nikuvakita vandu venavo va makabila gangi vavalinga Vaisilaeli, nilola ngati vakuyiwuyila njila yangu ngati vagogo vavi amala lepi.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga avalekili vandu va makabila genago vasigalila mumulima, wala kuvavinga wala amtangatili lepi Yoshua kuvahotola vandu va makabila ago.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Vandu va makabila gangi vevasigalili ku mulima wa Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Bambu Chapanga avalekili vandu va milima yingi ndava ya kuvalinga Vaisilaeli vangayimanya ngondo pa mulima wa Kanani. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Akitili chenicho muni chiveleku cha vandu va Isilaeli muni vamanyayi kutovana ngondo, avawula muni vamanya lepi kutovana ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Milima yeyalekiwi ndi yeniyi, vachilongosi muhanu va Vafilisiti na Vakanani voha na Vasidoni na Vahivi vevahamalili ku hitumbi ya Lebanoni kuhumila chitumbi Baali Helimoni mbaka kuhika Hamati. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Bambu Chapanga avalekili venavo ndava ya kuvalinga Vaisilaeli, alola ngati viyidakila malagizu gaki geampelili Musa muni vavapela vagogo vavi. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Hinu, Vaisilaeli vatamili pamonga na Vakanani na Vahiti na Vaamoli na Vapelezi na Vahivi na Vayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Vaisilaeli vagegili vasikana va makabila genago na vasikana vavi kuvagegesa vasongolo makabila genago na kufugamila michapanga ya vandu venavo.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhamula Otinieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Vaisilaeli vakitili uhakau palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga wavi, vakamkosewa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wavi na kufugamila michapanga ya Mabaali na Maashela. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Hinu, Bambu Chapanga akavayomela Vaisilaeli, na mwene akavakita vatovewa na Kushani Lishataimu nkosi wa Mesopotamia, ndi Vaisilaeli vamuhengili Kushani Lishataimu mulukumbi lwa miaka nane. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Vaisilaeli vamvembili Bambu Chapanga na mwene akavahagulila mundu wa kuvagombola ndi Otinieli mwana wa Kenazi, mbena waki Kalebu. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Hinu, Mpungu wa Bambu wambwelili Otinieli, na mwene akavya muhamula wa Vaisilaeli. Otinieli ahambili kungondo, na Bambu Chapanga akamuhotosa kumuhotola Kushani Lishataimu nkosi wa Mesopotamia. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Ndi mulima ukavya na uteke mulukumbi lwa miyaka alubaini. Mbaka Otinieli mwana wa Kenazi peafwili.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhamula Ehudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Kangi Vaisilaeli vahengili kangi uhakau palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Bambu Chapanga akampela makakala Egiloni nkosi wa Moabu avatova Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Nkosi Egiloni akawungana na Vaamoni na Vaamaleki, akahamba nawu kutovana na Vaisilaeli, vakavahotola na kuutola muji wa Yeliko kwa liina lingi ukemiwa muji wa mitende. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Vaisilaeli vakavya muuvanda wa kumuhengili Egiloni nkosi wa Moabu mumiyaka kumi na nane.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Nambu Vaisilaeli pavamvembili Bambu Chapanga, mwene avahagulili mundu wa kuvagombola ndi Ehudi mwana wa Gela wa likabila la Benjamini mwaihengela chiwoko cha mangenya. Vaisilaeli vamtumili apeleka njombi zavi kwa Eligoni nkosi wa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehudi ajitengenezili upanga weutema pandi zivili, utali waki sendimita hamusini. Akaukunga muchiwunu chaki upandi wa kulyela mugati ya magwanda gaki. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Kangi ampelekili Egiloni njombi zila. Egiloni avi mundu mweakulupalili neju. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi pamalili kugotola njombi zila kwa nkosi, akavajovela vandu vevagegili njombi vawuka. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Nambu mwene pahikili pachimong'omong'o cha maganga gegahongoliwi papipi na ku Giligali, akamuwuyila Egiloni akajova, “Nkosi nivi na ujumbi wa chimfiyu nigana kukujovela.” Nkosi akavalagiza vatumisi vaki vahuma kuvala mutileka tavete.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Nkosi avii atami mwene muchumba chaki cha kunani chachiyingisa mbepu, ndi Ehudi akamuhegelela na kumjovela “Nivi na ujumbi waku kuhuma kwa Chapanga.” Nkosi akayima pachigoda chaki. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehudi akaholomola upanga waki kwa chiwoko chaki cha kumangeya na kumuhoma Egiloni mulutumbu. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Upanga wayingili pamonga na mkamulilu waki, wahumalili mumbele na mahuta gagubiki upanga wenuwo muni Ehudi aholomwili lepi. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Kangi, Ehudi akahuma kuvala ya chumba na akadinda milyangu wa chumba chila kwa ufunguwo. <verse eid="JDG 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehudi peawukili, vatumisi va nkosi vakawuya. Pavalolili milyangu yidindiwi, vaholalili pangi ahambi kundindima muchumba cha mugati. <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Valindalili mbaka vakavya na wogoyu, pavalolili idindula lepi vakatola ufunguwo na kudindula milyangu. Vamkolili nkosi wavi agonili pahi kuni afwili.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Peavalindilayi, Ehudi atolwiki kupitila pachavili chimong'omong'o cha maganga, akatilila ku Seila. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Pahikili kwenuko ku mulima wa hitumbi ya Efulamu akabeta lipenenga lelimanyisa ngondo, ndi Vaisilaeli vakahelela pamonga nayu kuhuma kumilima yila ya hitumbi kuni mwene alongolili. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Akavajovela, “Munilanda, muni Bambu Chapanga avakili muvahotola vamakoko vinu Vamoabu.” Vakamlanda mbaka pakuyombokela kumfuleni wa Yolodani na kupatola pandu pa kuyombokela na valekili lepi Vamoabu vayomboka hati mumonga. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Ligono lenilo vavakomili manjolinjoli va Vamoabu elufu kumi vevana makakala na umanya wa kutovana ngondo, kawaka hati mmonga mweavatolwiki. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Ligono lenilo Vaisilaeli vavahotwili Vamoabu na mulima wavili na uteke mumiyaka semanini.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhamula Shamgali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Pahala pa Ehudi, akagelekela Shamgali mwana wa Anati, mweavatovili Vafilisiti miya sita kwa ndonga yeyihongwiki ya kuhikita ng'ombi zihamba kulongolo, na mwene mewa avagombwili Vaisilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Vahamula Debola na Balaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Paafwili Ehudi, Vaisilaeli vahengili kangi uhakau palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Bambu Chapanga avalekili vatovewa na nkosi Yabini wa Kanaani, mwaatalalilayi ku Hazoli. Mkulu wa manjolinjoli gaki avili Sisela, mweatamayi ku Halosheti mulima wa vandu vevangavya Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Nkosi Yabini avili na mutuka za lyuma miya tisa za kuhutwa na falasi za kutovanela ngondo. Avang'ahisi neju Vaisilaeli mumiyaka ishilini, ndi Vaisilaeli vakamvembela Bambu Chapanga avatangatila.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Lukumbi lwenulo kwavii na mlota wa Chapanga mdala mwakemiwa Debola wavili mdala wa Lapidoti. Mewa avi muhamula wa Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Debola avili na uyovalela wa kutama pahi ya mtende wewavili pagati ya muji wa Lama na muji wa Beseli ku mulima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu. Vandu va ku Isilaeli vamuhambili muni avahamula matakilu gavi. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Ligono limonga Debola amkemili Balaki mwana wa Abinoamu wa muji wa Kedeshi ku mulima wa Nafutali. Pabwelili amjovili, “Bambu Chapanga wa Vaisilaeli, akulagiza naha, ‘Uhamba ukavayola manjolinjoli vaku elufu kumi kuhuma makabila ga Nafutali na Zabuluni uvalongosa mbaka ku chitumbi cha Taboli. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Nene yati nikumkulukisa Sisela, mkulu wa manjolinjoli wa Yabini, abwela na manjolinjoli na mutuka zaki kutovana na veve kumfuleni wa Kishoni, na kukukita umuhotola.’”<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Balaki akamyangula Debola, “Ngati uhamba pamonga na nene, na nene yati nihamba. Nambu ngati uhamba lepi na nene, nene yati nihamba lepi.”<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debola akamyangula, “Chabwina, yati nihamba pamonga na veve, nambu yati wipata lepi utopesa wowoha wa uhotola, muni Bambu Chapanga yati akumleka Sisela atoviwa na mdala, ndi Debola akalongosana na Balaki vakahamba ku Kedeshi.” <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Balaki akavakemela manjolinjoli va makabila ga Nafutali na Zabuluni ku Kedeshi kwenuko, vandu alufu kumi vakamlanda. Debola akahamba pamonga nayu.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Lukumbi lwenulo, Hebeli mundu wa likabila la Vakemi ajivikili patali na Vakemi vayaki va uveleku wa Hobabu, mkohanu wa Musa. Ajengili lindanda laki kutali kwenuko ku mkongo uvaha weuvi ku muji wa Zaananimu, papipi na Kedeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Sisela peayuwini kuvya Balaki mwana wa Abinoamu ahambili kuchitumbi Taboli, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisela akatola manjolinjoli pamonga na mutuka zaki miya tisa za ngondo zezihutwa na falasi, akawuka ku Halosheti Hagoni, akahamba kumfuleni Kishoni.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Debola akamjovela Balaki, “Hamba! Lelu ndi Bambu Chapanga yati akutangatila umuhotola Sisela.” Wu, Bambu Chapanga akulongolili lepi kulongolo yaku! Hinu, Balaki akahelela kuhuma kuchitumbi Taboli kuni akuvalongosa manjolinjoli elufu kumi vamlandili. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Balaki peavazangili kwa upanga, ndi Bambu Chapanga akamkita Sisela pamonga na manjolinjoli na mutuka zaki za kuhutwa na falasi vakajikolela vavi mumang'aiso neju. Sisela akahuluka mumutuka yaki ya ngondo yeyihutwa na falasi na kutila kwa magendelu. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Balaki na manjolinjoli vaki avalandalili manjolinjoli va Sisela na mutuka zavi mbaka Halosheti yeyivi ku mulima wa vandu vangavya Vasilaeli na kuvakoma voha kwa upanga, asigalili lepi hati linjolinjoli mmonga.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Nambu Sisela ajumbalili mbaka kulindanda la Yaeli mwaavi mdala wa Hebeli wa likabila la Vakeni. Akitili chenicho muni Yabini nkosi wa Hazoli atamili cha uteke na vandu va lukolo lwa Hebeli mwahumili ku likabila la Keni. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaeli akahamba kumpokela Sisela na kumjovela, “Mkulu wangu yingila mugati kotoka kuyogopa.” Ndi Akayingila mulindanda la Yaeli na Yaeli akumgubika Sisela kwa libulangeti. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisela akamjovela Yaeli, “Pepayi, niyupa manji ninywe, muni nina njoto.” Hinu akadindula kahaku ka chikumba wewavili na mavele, akampela anywai, na kumgubika kangi. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sisela akamjovela, “Yima pamlyangu wa lindanda mundu yoyoha akabwela kukota ngati pavi mundu yoyoha penapa, bela mjovela kawaka mundu.”<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Ndi Yaeli mdala Hebeli akatola chibiki cha lindanda na nyundo, akamuhambila nyemunyemu kuni Sisela agonili lugono muni atotokili na lugendu. Yaeli akakongomela chibiki chenicho pachiwungi ndi chayingili mbaka paludaka, bahopo Sisela akafwa. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Hinu Balaki pamlandayi Sisela, Yaeli ahumili kuvala na kumpokela akamjovela, “Bwela na nene yati nikulasa mundu mwaukumlonda.” Balaki akayingila mulindanda la Yaeli na kumkolela Sisela pahi, afwili, na chibiki cha lindanda pachiwungi chaki.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Hinu, ligono lenilo Chapanga avakitili Vaisilaeli vamuhotola nkosi Yabini wa Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Manjolinjoli va Vaisilaeli vayendalili kuvya na makakala neju ya manjolinjoli ga Yabini nkosi wa Kaanani, pamwisu manjolinjoli ga Isilaeli vavakomamikisi njwe Yabini na manjolinjoli gaki.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Lunyimbu lwa Debola na Balaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Ligono lenilo, Debola na Balaki mwana wa Abinoamu vayimbili lunyimbu ulu.<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Vachilongosi vavalongwisi Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">vandu vajiwusili kwa kugana vene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">Mumlumba Bambu Chapanga!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Muyuwanila nyenye vankosi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Muyuwana nyenye vakulu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Yati nikumyimbila Bambu Chapanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Yati nikumyimbila Bambu Chapanga lunyimbu lwa kumlumba, Chapanga wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Veve Bambu Chapanga pawahumili ku Seili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">pawahelili kuchitumbi Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">mulima wandendimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">kunani kwa Chapanga kwagwisili manji, na mahundi gatonyisi fula.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Hitumbi yanyugusiki palongolo yaku Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">hati chitumbi sinai chanyugusiki palongolo yaku, veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mumagono ga Shamgali mwana wa Anati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">mumagono ga Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">njila zivaha zavi lepi na vandu vevapitayi kuhamba kugulisa na kugula vindu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">vanalugendu vapitili njila za mumihana.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Valimaji valekili kulima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">mbaka panahumalili nene Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">nene mwanivili ngati mau wa vandu Vaisilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Vaisilaeli pevamulekili Chapanga na kujihagulila mchapanga wungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Kukahumalila ngondo pamulima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Nambu avi lepi hati mlota mmonga mweakamwili mgoha amala mweakamwili chingwamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">pagati ya manjolinjoli elufu alubaini va Isilaeli<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Nikuvalumba vakulu va manjolinjoli va Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">vevajiwusili kwa kugana kwavi vene pagati ya vandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Mumlumba Bambu Chapanga!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Nyenye mwemukwela punda zamsopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">nyenye mwamutamila vindu vya kutamila vya mashonga gamahele, vyevivikwa panani yaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">nyenye mwamugenda munjila mkokosa lijambu lenilo.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Muyuwanila lwami, za nyimbu za misambi ya vandu vevitindila viliva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">ava viyimba kuhotola kwa Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">uhotola wa vandu vaki kumulima wa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Penapo vandu va Bambu Chapanga vahulwiki mumilyangu ya muji.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Yimuka, Debola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Yimuka uyimba lunyimbu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Yimuka Balaki mwana wa Abinoamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">uvatola vandu vaku veuvakamwili kungondo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Vee wamwana wa Abinoamu. <verse eid="JDG 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Vakekesi vevasigalili vahelili kuwuya kwa vachilongosi vavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">vandu va Bambu Chapanga vabwelili kwa nene, kukomana na vamakoko vitu vevanamakakala.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Vabwelili manjolinjoli kuhuma likabila la Efulaimu vakahelela kunyasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">vakalanda valongo vavi vandu va likabila la Benjamini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">kuhuma mulukolo lwa Makili vakabwela vakulu va manjolinjoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">kuhuma mu likabila la Zebuluni vabwelili vachilongosi vakulu.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Vakulu va likabila la Isakali valandini na Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Chakaka, vandu va likabila la Isakali vamlandili Balaki mewa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">vamlandili mbaka kunyasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Nambu vandu va likabila la Lubeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">vahotwi lepi kuhamula vahamba amala vakoto kuhamba<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Ndava kyani mwasigalili mumbele pamonga na misambi ya mambelele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Wu, mwamuyuwanila lukwilu za vadimaji vikemela mambelele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Chakaka lukolo za Lubeni zagavanyiki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">vahotwi lepi kuhamula vahamba amala vakoto kuhamba<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Vandu va ku Gileadi vatamili kumwambu ya mfuleni Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">vandu va likabila la Dani vasigalili muwatu yivaha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Vandu va likabila la Asheli mewawa vatamili munyumba zavi papipi na nyanja.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Manjolinjoli va likabila la Zabuloni vayogwipi lepi kufwa kungondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">mewawa na manjolinjoli va likabila la Nafutali vayogwopi kuvazangila vamakoko vavi.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Ku Tanaki, pamuhana ya chinyepa cha Megido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">vankosi vabwelili na kutovana, vankosi va ku Kanaani vatovini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">nambu vatinyagili lepi madini ga feza.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Ndondo zatovini ngondo uko kunani ku mahundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">ngati pezagendayi munjila zaki, zatovini na Sisela.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Manji gamahele ga mfuleni Kishoni gavayolili kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">chakaka manji gamahele ga mfuleni Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">veve mpungu wangu uyendelela kulongolo kwa makakala!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Falasi za Sisela zapitili na kupalu palu kwa chigigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">zakitili chigigi na kwatu zavi.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Mtumu wa kuanani kwa Chapanga ijova naha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">“Muupela likoto vandu muji wa Melozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">muvapela likoto neju vandu vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">muni vabeli kutangatila ngondo za Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">vabelili kutovana na vamakoko va Bambu Chapanga vevana makakala.”<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Yaeli amotisiwa kuliku vadala voha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">mdala wa Hebeli, mweihumila kumulima wa Kemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">amotisiwa kuliku vadala voha vevitama mumandanda.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisela amyupili manji, na mwene ampelili mavele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">amletili magindani munkeve wa utopesa.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Kwa chiwoko kumangiha akamwili chibiki cha lindanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">na muchiwoko cha kulyela akamwili nyundu ya fundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">akamubowola mutu waki na kumbonda Sisela mutu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">adenyili na kubayula chiwungi chaki,<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisela agundimi, akagwa, pamagendelu ga Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">agonili nuu pamagendelu ga Yaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Pala peagundimi ndi afwili.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Nyina waki Sisela alolokesa palidilisha na penapo palidilisha akatumbula kujova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">ndava kyani mutuka yaki ya kuhutwa na falasi yicheliwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Ndava kyani vigigi vya falasi waki vicheliwi kuyuwanika?<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Vadala vevana luhala vevamhengela vakamyangula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">akajipolesa mtima kangi na kangi kwa liyangulo lenilo.<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />Chakaka vilonda na kugavana vindu vyevanyagili kungondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">msikana mmonga amala vavili kwa kila linjolinjoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ligwanda la mangoma ga langi ndava ya Sisela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ligwanda la mangoma ga limbelele lelitotiwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">na magwanda gavili gegatotiwi mapambu ndava yangu.<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Veve Bambu Chapanga makoko vaku vafwayi voha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">nambu vala vevakukugana vavyai ngati mabalala pala peyilanga lukumbi lilanga pelihuma kwa lumuli luvaha!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Na mulima wavili na uteke njwe kwa miyaka alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Muhamula Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Vaisilaeli vakitili kangi uhakau palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, na mwene akavakita vatalaliwa na Vamidiani mumiyaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Vamidiani vavahengili gahakau neju Vaisilaeli, mbaka Vaisilaeli vajumbalili kuhitumbi na kujigimila malindi na mbugu za hitumbi kuvya ngomi zavi za kujihiha. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Vaisilaeli pavapandili mbeyu mumigunda, Vamidiani na Vaamaleki na vandu vangi kuhuma kwelihumila lilanga vabwelili kuvazangila. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Vandu venavo vavikili kambi pa mulima, na kuhalabisa mabenu goha pamulima mbaka mumibaka ya Gaza, vavalekili lepi Vaisilaeli chochoha, mambelele amala ng'ombi amala punda. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Vandu venavo vabwelili vamahele ngati mambalanguli vabwelili pamonga na ng'ombi na ngamiya na mambelele gavi mandanda gavi, vahalabisi mulima wa Isilaeli muni vavili vamahele neju na kawaka mundu mweahotwili kuvavalanga. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Vamidiani vatolili kila chindu cha Vaisilaeli, mbaka Vaisilaeli vamvembili Bambu Chapanga avatangatila.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Vaisilaeli pavamvembili Bambu Chapanga avawusa mumang'aisu gegavakolili kuhuma kwa Vamidiani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Bambu Chapanga avapelekili mlota, na mwene akavajovela, “Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, ijova naha, navawusili kumulima wa Misili kwemwavili mwavavanda. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Navasangwili muutalila wa Vamisili na vandu voha vevatovini na nyenye pamulima uwu. Na nene navavingili vandu venavo palongolo yinu na kuvapela nyenye uwu mulima wavi uvya winu. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Kangi nikavajovela, nene ndi Bambu Chapanga winu, mkoto kufugamila michapanga ya Vaamoli, vala vemutama pamulima wavi! Nambu nyenye mwaniyidakili lepi nene.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akahamba, akatama pahi ya mkongo uvaha wa Yoashi mundu wa lukolo lwa Abiezeli, ku Ofula. Gidioni mwana wa Yoashi, apeta nganu pandu pa kuminyila zabibu ajihihili muni Vamidiani vakotoka kumuwona. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamuhumila Gidioni, akamjovela “Bambu Chapanga avi pamonga na veve mkekesi!”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidioni akamjovela, “Mkulu wangu yikavya Bambu Chapanga avili pamonga na tete, mboni mambu aga goha gatihumili? Gavi kwoki matendu gaki gakukangasa gevatijovili vagogo vitu pala pevajovili, Bambu Chapanga ndi mwatiwusili ku mulima wa Misili? Nambu hinu Bambu Chapanga atilekili na kutikita titovewa na Vamidiani!”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Bambu Chapanga akamng'anamukila na kumjovela, “Hamba kwa makakala gaku goha geuvii nagu ukavasangula Vaisilaeli kuhuma kwa Vamidiani. Nene lepi mwanikutuma.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gidioni akamyangula, “Pepai Bambu Chapanga, yati nihotola wuli kuvasangula Vaisilaeli? Muni lukolo lwangu ndi lwangali makakala ga kutovana ngondo mulikabila la Manase, nene mwene nimanyikana lepi munyumba ya dadi wangu!”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela, “Nene yati nivya pamonga na veve, na yati ukuvakoma Vamidiani voha changali kunonopa ngati ukumkoma mundu mmonga.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidioni akamjovela, “Ngati uganiswi na nene, nilangisa ulangisu muni nimanya chakaka kuvya veve ndi Bambu mwaulongela na nene. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Nikuyupa kotoka kuwuka penapa mbaka peniwuya na kukuletela njombi.” Bambu Chapanga akamyangula, “Yati nitama penapa mbaka peuwuya.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gidioni akahamba kunyumba yaki akateleka nyama ya mpapakasi na akatola uhembe kilo kumi na kuteleka mabumunda gangali ngemeku, akasopa mabumunda na nyofu muchidengu na msusu muchiviga, kangi akampelekela pala pa mkongo uvaha wa mwaloni na kuvika palongolo yaki. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamjovela, “Tola nyama na mabumunda gangali ngemeku uvika panani ya litalahu lenili. Kangi sopa msusu panani ya nyama na mabumunda.” Na mwene Gidioni akakita chenicho. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Kangi mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akagolosa ndonga yaki na kupamisa nyama na mabumunda. Chigafula motu ukahuma palitalau ukatinyisa nyama na mabumunda genago. Penapo mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akahovalela.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Ndi Gidioni akamanya kuvya mwenuyo ndi mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akavemba, “Nikita wuli, veve Bambu Chapanga wangu muni nimuwene mtumu waku wa kunani kwa mihu gangu hinu yati nifwa.”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga akamjovela, “Utama kwa uteke, kotoka kuyogopa yati wifwa lepi.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gidioni akayola maganga na akamjengela Bambu Chapanga pandu pakuwusila luteta na kupakemela, “Bambu Chapanga ndi Uteke.” Pandu pakuwusila luteta penapo pavii mbaka lelu kwenuko ku Ofula, ku muji wa Vabiezeli.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Kilu yiyo Bambu Chapanga amjovili Gidioni, “Tola ng'ombi yigosi yimonga ya dadi waku, yila ng'ombi ya pili yeyivii na miyaka saba. Bomola pandu pakuwusila luteta kwa Baali yeavili nayu dadi waku na kudenya chimong'omng'o cha Ashela chechivili pamuhana ya pandu pa kuwusila teta. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Kangi, unijengela nene Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, pandu pa kuwusila luteta panani ya litalawu lenili ngati cheyiganikiwa. Kangi uniwusila luteta lwa kutinyisa ya ng'ombi ya pili yila kwa kuhengela sagala zila za chimong'mong'o cha Ashela chawadenyidenyili.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Ndi Gidioni akatola vatumisi vaki kumi, akakita ngati chalagizwi na Bambu Chapanga. Nambu ndava muni ayogwipi valongo vaki na vandu va pabomani, ahotwili lepi kukita mambu genago muhi nambu akitili kilu.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Vakolonjinji va muji pavayumwiki lukela pehe valolili pandu pa kuwusila luteta pa chapanga Baali padenywili na chomong'ong'o cha Ashela yeyavii pamuhana na pandu pa kuwusila teta padenyiwi. Ng'ombi ya pili yila yatinyiswi panani ya pandu pangi pamupya pakuwusila luteta pepajengiwi penapo. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Vakakotana, “Yani mwakitili lijambu lenili?” Pavakitili umang'omesi vamanyili kuvya Gidioni mwana wa Yoashi ndi mwakitili genago. <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Vandu va pamuji vamuhambili Yoashi vakamjovela, “Muleta mwana waku apa timukome, muni adenyili pandu pakuwusila luteta kwa chapanga Baali na kudenya chomong'omong'o cha Ashela yeyavili pamuhana yaki.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Nambu Yoashi akavajovela vandu vala vevamlandili, “Wu, nyenye mukumkengelela Baali? Wu, yati mukumsangula? Mundu yoyoha mweakumkengelela Baali akomewa mewawa kwakona kwangacha. Ngati Baali ndi chapanga, hinu, mumlekayi ajikengelela mwene muni pandu paki pa kuwusila luteta pabomolwi.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Ligono lenilo vampelili Gideoni lihina la Yelu Baali, mana yaki ndi, “Baali ajikengelela mwene” Muni pandu paki pa kuwusila luteta ndi pepabomoliwi.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Kangi Vamidiani na Vaamaleki na vandu voha vevatama kwelihumila lilanga vakonganiki pamonga vakayomboka mfueni Yolodani vakavika kambi palikemba la Yezileeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Nambu Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga ukambwelela na kumulongosa Gidioni, na mwene akabeta lipenenga kuvakemela manjolinjoli va lukolo lwa Abiezeli vabwela vamlanda. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Akavatuma vajumbi pamulima woha, vahamba kuvakemela manjolinjoli voha va likabila la Manase vabwela kumlanda. Vajumbi vangi akavatuma vakavakemela vandu va makabila ga Asheli na Zebuluni na Nafutali, na vene vakabwela kuwungana nayu.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Gidioni akamjovela Chapanga, “Ujovi yati ukunitangatila nene kuvagombola Vaisilaeli, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />lola nivika chikumba cha limbelele pa luvanja lwa kupepetela nganu. Ngati lukela kwivya na mbetu panani ya chikumba ndu na mulima woha ukasigalila uyumu, penapo yati nimanya kuvya yati ukunitangatila nene kuvasangula Vaisilaeli.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Lijambu lenilo likatimila, muni Gidioni peayimwiki lukela aweni mbetu panani ya chikumba, aminyili chikumba chenicho na manji ukamema munkeve. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Kangi Gidioni akamjovela Chapanga, “Pepayi, kotoka kuniyomela, nileka nikuyupa chindu chingi kangi. Niyupa nikulinga kavili kwa chikumba chichichi, niyupa chikumba ichi nduu chiyuma nambu mulima woha utepetela kwa mbetu.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Chapanga akitili chenicho kilu yeniyo, muni panani ya chikumba pavili payumu na mulima woha watepatili kwa mbetu.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni akuvahotola Vamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Kangi Yelubaali mewawa mweakemiwi Gidioni na vandu voha vevavili pamonga nayu vayimwiki lukela, vakavika kambi yavi kunyasi papipi na chinyepa cha Halodi, na pandu pa kugona pa Vamidiani pavili upandi wavi wa ku kasikazini, ku likemba papipi na chitumbi Mole.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Gidioni, “Vandu veuvili navu ndi vamahele neju kwa nene kuvakita Vamidiani vatovewa na nyenye. Hinu Vaisilaeli valajilumba na kujova kuvya vajisangwi vene kwa makakala gavi na lepi nene ndi mwenivatangatili. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Hinu vakokosela vandu voha kuvya, ‘Mundu yoyoha mwana wogoyu amala mwaindendema awuya kunyumba yaki awuka pa chitumbi Gileadi.’” Hinu, vandu alufu ishilini na vavili vakawuya kunyumba yavi na kusigalila vandu alufu kumi.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Gidioni, “Vandu veuvi nawu vakona vamahele. Hinu vahelesa kuchinyepa na nene yati nikuvalinga kwenuko. Mundu yoyoha mwanikujovela, mwenuyu hamba naku, mwenuyo ahamba veve. Nambu mundu yoyoha mwanikujovela kotoka kuhamba naku ndi mundu mwenuyo akotoka kuhamba na veve.” <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Hinu, Gidioni akavatola vandu vala akavapeleka kumfuleni na Bambu Chapanga akamjovela, “Vandu vala vevinywa manji kwa kumyanga manji ngati mabwa ndi uvalekanganisa na vala vevinywa manji kwa kufugama.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Vandu vevanywili manji kwa kulapulila ngati mabwa ndi vavili miya zidatu. Nambu vangi voha vevasigalili vafugimi kunywa manji. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Gidioni, “Venavo vandu miya zidatu vevanywili kwa kumyanga ngati mabwa, kupitila vandu avo yati nikuvasangula Vaisilaeli yati nikuvakita Vamidiani vatovewa na veve. Nambu vangi voha vevasigalili vajovela vawuya kunyumba zavi.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Kangi manjolinjoli vakatola yakulya na mapenenga ga vala vevawuyayi, kangi akavalaga vahamba kunyumba zavi. Mwene asigalili na vandu miya zidatu. Pandu pa kugona pa Vamidiani pavili kulikemba.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Kilu yeniyo, Bambu Chapanga amjovili Gidioni, “Yumuka helela ukavatova mukambi zavi, muni nikukitili veve uvahotola. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Nambu ngati uyogopa kuhamba, hamba pamonga na mtumisi waku Pula uhamba ku pandu pavi pevigona. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Kwenuko yati uyuwana gevijova na veve yati upata makakala ga kuvatova.” Gidioni akahamba pamonga na Pula mtumisi waki mbaka kula kwevatamayi valonda va kambi za Vamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Vamidiani na Vaamaleki na vandu voha va kwelihumila lilanga vadandasiki kulikemba, vavii vamahele ngati mambalanguli, na ngamiya zavi zangavalangika zavili zamahele ngati msavati wa kumbwani.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gidioni pahikili, amyuwini mundu mmonga akumkokosela myaki njozi yaki naha, “Nalotili njozi. Naweni libumunda la Shayili libilinduka mbaka pa kambi za Vamidiani, ukalitova lindanda limonga na kuling'anamusa pahi kuvya kunani na likagona pahi.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Muyaki akamyangula, “Njozi yeniyo yilangisa ndi upanga wa yula Gidioni mwana wa Yoashi mundu wa Isilaeli. Chapanga amkitili avahotola Vamidiani pamonga na manjolinjoli gitu goha.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gidioni payuwini ndoto ya mundu yula na udandaula waki, akamfugamila Chapanga. Kangi akawuya kukambi ya Vaisilaeli, akajova, “Muyimuka tihamba muni Bambu Chapanga atikitili tete tivatova manjolinjoli ga Vamidiani.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Hinu akavagava manjolinjoli vala miya zidatu misambi yidatu, kila mmonga akampela mapenenga na chihulu vyangali manji na kuvika lumuli mugati yaki. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Akavajovela, “Munilolokesa, mkita ngati chenikita, penihika papipi na kambi. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Petipula mapenenga, nene pamonga na msambi wangu, mwavoha mpula mapenenga kuhuma kila upandi na kujova kwa lwami luvaha, ‘Mtovana ndava ya Chapanga! na mtovana ndava ya Gidioni.’”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Pelwahegalili kilu neju, Gidioni na msambi waki wa manjolinjoli miya yimonga, vakahika pa mwishu wa kambi. Lukumbi lwenulo valonda vevavii vawukayi muni vayingila valonda vangi. Gidioni na msambi waki vakapula mapenenga na kubayula vihulu vyevakamwili mumawoko gavi. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Na misambi yila ivili vakakita chilachila. Mumawoko gavi ga kumangeya vakamwili milumuli na mawoko ga kulyela vakamwili mapenenga na kupyula kwa lwami luvaha, vakajova, “Mtovana kwa upanga ndava ya Bambu Chapanga na mtovana kwa upanga ndava ya Gidioni!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Kila linjolinjoli ayimili pandu paki kutindila kambi. Nambu manjolinjoli va Vamidiani vatilili kwa wogohi kuni vivembeneka. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Vandu va Gidioni pavapyulili mapenenga gavi miya zidatu, Bambu Chapanga avakitili vamanjolinjoli va Vamidiani kila mmonga atumbula kutola upanga na kumkoma myaki. Vala vevasigalili vajumbili kutali neju mbaka ku Selela pepiyelekela Beti shita, vakahamba kutali neju mbaka kumbaka wa ku Abeli meholi papipi na Tabati.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Vaisilaeli va likabila la Nafutali na likabila la Asheli na likabila la Manase voha, vakemiwi vakavalanda Vamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gidioni akatuma vajumbi kwoha kumulima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu vakakokosa, “Muvajovela manjolinjoli vahelela kuvadivalila na kuvatova Vamidiani kwa kutola pandu za kuyombokela mu mifuleni hidebe na kwa mfuleni Yoludani mbaka uko ku Beti Bala.” Hinu manjolinjoli voha va Efulaimu vakabwela na kutola pandu pa kuyombokela mbaka uko ku Beti Bala. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Vavatolili mateka vachilongosi vavili va Vamidiani, ndi Olebu na Zeebu. Vamkomili Olebu palitalau la Olebu, mewa na Zeebu vamkomili pandu pakuminyila zabibu. Kangi vayendalili kuvalandalila Vamidiani. Vampelekili Gidioni mutu wa Olebu na mutu wa Zebu, kumwambu ya mfuleni Yolodani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni akuvahotola Vamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Vandu va Efulaimu vamkotili Gidioni, “Ndava kyani utihengili naha? Ndava kyani watikemili lepi pawahambili kutovana na Vamidiani?” Hinu ndi vakavembeneka neju.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Nambu Gidioni akavayangula, “Mambu gamuhengili nyenye ndi gavaha neju kuliku gala ganihengi nene pamonga na vandu va lukolo lwangu. Chila chidebe chavakitili vandu va Efulaimu pavamalili kubena ndi chabwina kuliku mabenu ga valongo vangu va Abieezeli. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Chapanga avahotwisi nyenye muvakoma Olebu na Zeebu vankosi va Midiani. Wu, nene nikitili kyani kulinganisa na nyenye?” Gidioni pamalili kujova genago, vakaleka kumyomela.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Kwa lukumbi ulu Gidioni pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki miya zidatu vahikili ku mfuleni Yolodani, vakayomboka. Pamonga vatotokili neju nambu vayendelili kuvalandalila Vamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Pavahikili ku Sukoti akavajovela vandu va muji wenuwo, “Pepayi muvapela manjolinjoli vangu chakulya valyayi muni vatotokili neju, nene nakona niyendelela kuvalandalila vankosi va ku Midiani Zeba na Salimuna.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Nambu vachilongosi va Sukoti vakamkota Gidioni, “Ndava kyani tivapela chakulya manjolinjoli kwakona kumkamula Zeba na Salimuna?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidioni akavajovela, “Chakaka, nambu Bambu Chapanga pakunitangatila kuvakamula Zeba na Salimuna, yati niwuya na kuvatova kwa minga na mbigili za kulugangatu!” <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Gidioni akawuka penapo na kuvahambila vandu va Penueli, akavayupa namuna yilayila, na vandu va Penueli vamuyangwili ngati chavayangwili vandu va ku Sukoti. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Gidioni akavajovela, “Paniwuya kuni nivahotwili vankosi avo yati nikuubomola mnala uwu!”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Zeba na Salimuna vavili ku Kalikoli pamonga na manjolinjoli elufu kumi na muhanu ndi vevasigalili kuhuma kwa vandu vaki va kwelihumila lilanga, muni vayavi laki yimonga na elufu ishilini vakomiwi. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gidioni akalanda njila ya upandi wa kwelitipama lilanga yeyivili upandi wa kwelihumila lilanga mwa Noba na Yogibeha, akalizangila manjolinjoli ago chigafula. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Vankosi venavo va Midiani, Zeba na Salimuna vatolwiki na kutila, nambu Gidioni avalandili na kuvakamula, na manjolinjoli voha vayogwipi.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Kangi Gidioni, mwana wa Yoashi, akawuya kuhuma kungondo kwa kupita pandu pa kuholotela papikemiwa Helesi. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Akamkamula msongolo mmonga wa ku Sukoti na kumkotakesa. Msongolo yula akamyandikila mahina ga vachilongosi na vagogo vavimanyikana neju va ku Sukoti, venavo voha vavili vandu sabini na saba. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Gidioni akawuya kwa vandu va ku Sukoti, akavajovela, “Mukumbuka pamwaniligili na kujova, ‘Ndava kyani kuvapela mabumunda vandu vaku vevatotoki neju kwakona mwangamkamula Zeba na Salimuna?’ Hinu Zeba na Salimuna ndi ava apa!” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Hinu, akavakamula vagogo voha va ku Sukoti na akavatova na kuvapapula higa zavi kwa minga na mbigili ndi livya lihakalilu kwavi. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Mewawa akaubomola mnala wa ku Penueli na kuvakoma vagosi voha va pa muji wenuwo.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Kangi Gidioni akavakota Zeba na Salimuna, “Wu, vandu vala vemwavakomili ku Taboli yavi wuli?” Vakamyangula, “Vawanini na veve, muni kila mumonga awonikini ngati mwana wa nkosi.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gidioni akavajovela, “Venavo vavili valongo vangu, vana va nyina wangu wa kuniveleka. Nilapa kwa Chapanga mwavili mumi, kuvya ngamuvakomili lepi, hati nene nganivakomi lepi nyenye.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Kangi akamjovela Yateli, mvelekanu waki wa kutumbula, “Vakoma venava.” Yateli ayogwipi kuutola upanga waki muni avi akona mdebe.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Penapo Zeba na Salimuna vakajova, “Tikoma wamwene muni lenili ndi lihengu la mundu mvaha.” Hinu Gidioni akavakoma Zeba na Salimuna na akatola mapambu gegavili muhingu za ngamiya zavi.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Vaisilaeli vakamjovela Gidioni, “Veve ndi uvya chilongosi witu, veve pamonga na viveleku vyaku vyavibwela, muni veve utigombwili kwa Vamidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gidioni akavayangula, “Nene yati nivya lepi mtalila winu amala viveleku vyangu. Bambu Chapanga ndi mwakuvalongosa.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Kangi akavajovela, “Nigana kuvayupa chindu chimonga, niyupa kila mmonga winu anipela ndolola zamwanyagili kungondo.” Vamidiani vala vavii Vaishimaeli, ndi vawalayi vindu vya zahabu.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Vakamyangula, “Yati tikupela kwa kugana tavete.” Hinu vatandiki nyula na voha mmonga mmonga akatagila ndolola yaki pa nyula yeniyo. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Utopa wa ndolola zevampelili zavii kilo ishilini. Mewawa apewili ndolola za pameng'elu za mashonga gamahele, nyula zabwina za langi ya zambalau zaziwaliwa na vankosi va ku Midiani, na mikufu yeyavii muhingu za ngamia zavi. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gidioni atumili zahabu zeniyo zoha kutengenezela chindu cha zahabu chechiwanangana na nyula ya kugubika panganga lavawalili vamteta va Isilaeli akachivika ku muji waki wa Ofula. Vaisilaeli voha vahambili kuchifugamila Chindu chenicho. Ndi chindu chenicho chikavya lingongeka kwa Gidioni na vandu va munyumba yaki.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Hinu, Vamidiani vatoviwi na Vaisilaeli, na vavang'aili lepi kavili Vaisilaeli. Na mulima woha wa Isilaeli wavili na uteke kwa miyaka alubaini magono goha Gidioni peavi mumi.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifwa la Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Gidioni mewawa lihina laki lingi Yelubaali mweavi mwana wa Yoashi awuyili kunyumba yaki na kutama kwenuko. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gidioni avili na vana vagosi sabini, muni agegili vadala vamahele. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Mewawa Gidioni avili na mdala yungi uko ku Shekemu mwenuyo amvelekili mwana mgosi lihina laki Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gidioni mwana wa Yoashi, afwili pavili mgogolo neju, azikiwi mulitinda la Yoashi, dadi waki, ku muji wa Ofula wa lukolo lwa Vabiezeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Peafwili Gidioni, Vaisilaeli vayiwuyili michapanga ya Baali na kuyifugamila. Vakamkita Baali Beliti kuvya chapanga wavi. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Vaisilaeli vamukosiwi Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wavi, mweavasangwili kuhuma kwa makoko vavi vevavatindili pandi zoha. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Mewawa vavahengili lepi gabwina vandu va lukolo lwa Yelubaali lihina laki lingi Gidioni kwa gala goha gevahengili vandu va Isilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Muhamula Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Ligono limonga Abimeleki, mwana wa Gidioni, ahambili kwa vajomba vaki na kwa valongo vangi va nyina waki vavitama ku Shekemu, akavajovela, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />Muvakota vandu voha va ku Shekemu, “Ki chabwina kwinu, kutalaliwa na vana voha sabini va Yelubaali amala mtalaliwa na mundu mmonga mwene? Mkumbuka kuvya nene na nyenye ndi tavalongo va chakaka.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Valongo va nyina waki vavajovili vandu va ku Shekemu gala gevajoviwi na Abimeleki, na vandu voha va ku Shekemu vakamlanda Abimeleki muni avili mlongo wavi. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Vakampela hipandi sabini ya madini ga feza vyevyavili munyumba ya Baali Beliti, na mwene Abumeleki atumili vipandi vyenivyo kuvagongole vandu vanaluhonda na vandu vayimu muni vamtangatila. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Akalandana nawu kuhamba ku muji wa dadi waki ku Ofula na kwenuko akavakoma valongo vaki voha sabini panani ya liganga limonga. Nambu Yotamu mweavili mwana wa mwishu kuvelekewa wa Yelubali akomiwi lepi muni ajifiyili. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Vandu voha va ku Shekemu na Beti Milo vakakonganeka pahi ya mkongo uvaha weuvi papipi na liganga la ukumbuso ku Shekemu, vakamkita Abimeleki kuvya nkosi wavi.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Yotamu payuwini makokoso genago, akahamba kuyima panani ya chitumbi Gelizimu, akajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Muniyuwanila nyenye mwavandu va Shekemu ngati mgana Chapanga avayuwanila nyenye. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Ligono limonga mikongo yahambili kujihagulila nkosi wavi. Ndi yikaujovela mzeituni, ‘Veve uvya nkosi witu!’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Nambu mzeituni akayangula, ‘Muholalela nihotola kuleka lihengu langu la kuwusa mahuta gangu gegilumbiwa na michapanga na vandu nihamba kujing'aisa kutalalila mikongo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Kangi mikongo yikaujovela mkongo wa mtini, ‘Bwela veve utitalalila.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Nambu chikongo cha mtini chikayangula, ‘Wu, muholalela nihotola kuleka lihengu langu la kupambika matunda gabwina na geginoga, na nibwela kuyitalalila mikongo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Ndi mikongo yikaujovela mzabibu, ‘Bwela veve utitalalila.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Mzabibu ukayangula, ‘Wu nileka kuwusa divayi yeyisangalusa michapanga na vandu, nibwela kujing'aha kuyitalila mikongo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Pamwishu mikongo yoha yikaujovela mkongo wa minga, ‘Bwela veve utitalalila.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Mkongo wa minga ukayangula, ‘Ngati chakaka mgana nivatalalila, mbwela kutama pahi ya chimuhwili changu. Ndi ngati mgani lepi, hinu motu ndi yati niyakisa motu na kutinyisa mikongo ya mielezi ya ku Lebanoni.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Yotamu akayendelela kujova, “Hinu muholalela mukiti bwina na uchakaka kumkita Abimeleki kuvya nkosi? Wu, lwenulu ndi luhuna lwemukumlipa Yelu Baali na vandu va munyumba yaki kwa gala geavakitili? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Mmanya kuvya dadi wangu ajitendekili kufwa ndava ya kuvagombola nyenye kuhuma kwa Vamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Nambu lelu muvang'anamukili vandu va munyumba ya dadi wangu na kuvakoma vana sabini panani ya liganga limonga. Kangi mumkitili Abimeleki mwana wa mdala yungi wa dadi, avya nkosi wa vandu va Shekemu, ndava muni ndi mlongo winu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Hinu, ngati mkitili genago kwa ubwina na kwa kumtopesa Yelubaali na vandu va munyumba yaki, ndi Abimeleki avakita nyenye musangaluka, na nyenye mumkita mwene asangaluka. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Nambu ngati lepi, motu uhumila kwa Abimeleki na kuvatinyisa vandu va ku Shekemu na Beti Milo, mewawa motu uhumila kwa vandu va ku Shekemu na Beti Milo na kumtinyisa Abimeleki.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Kangi Yotamu akatilalila ku Beeli, akatama kwenuko ndava muni amyogwipi Abimeleki mlongo waki.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Hinu Abimeleki avatalalili vandu ku Isilaeli kwa likumbi lwa miyaka yidatu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Kangi Chapanga akavakita Abimeleki na vandu va ku Shekemu vakomana, na vene vakabela kumlanda Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Chapanga akitili chenicho muni kulipisa kukomiwa kwa vana sabini va Yelu Baali. Genago gahumalili muni Abimeleki peavakomili valongo vaki venavo kwa kutangatiwa na valongo vaki va ku Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Vandu va ku Shekemu vamnyemalili Abimeleki muni vambuna kuhuma munani ya hitumbi. Vandu venavo vavanyagili vindu vyavi vandu vevapitili kwenuko na Abimeleki akajovewa lijambu lenilo.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Kangi Gaali, mwana wa Ebedi, pamonga na valongo vaki vahambili kutama ku Shekemu. Na vandu va ku Shekemu vakamuhuvalila mwene muni avya chilongosi wavi. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Voha vakahuma kuhamba kumigunda ya mizabibu, vakayava zabibu na kutengeneza divayi na kukita mselebuko munyumba za mchapanga wavi vakalya na kunywa, kangi vakamliga Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaali, mwana wa Ebedi, akajova, “Tete ta vandu va ku Shekemu tivi wuli? Ndava kyani timuhengela Abimeleki? kwani mwene ndi yani? Mwene ndi mwana wa Gidioni nambu mlongo witu lepi njwee, ihotola lepi kuvya nkosi witu na tihotola lepi kumyidakila Zebuli mweamuhagwili atitalalila. Hinu ndi chabwina tivayidakila vandu va munyumba ya gogo witu Hamoli. <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Ngati nene nganivyai chilongosi wa ku Shekemu, nganimuwusi Abimeleki akoto kuvya nkosi. Nganimjovili, ‘Yongesa manjolinjoli gaku na ubwela titovana.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli, mtalalila wa muji, peayuwini malovi ga Gaali mwana wa Ebedi, akayoma neju. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Ndi akampelekela ujumbi Abimeleki ku Tolima akajova, “Gaali mwana wa Ebedi, pamonga na valongo vaki vabwelili kutama pamuji wa Shekemu, na vikulukisa vandu va muji vakubela veve. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Hinu mbwela kilu veve na vandu veuvi nawu, ndi uvanyemela kumigunda yeyivi papipi na muji. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Chilau lukela lilanga pelihuma, uuzangila neju muji wenuwo. Gaali pamonga na vandu vaki pavihuma kubwela kutovana na veve uvatova neju.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Hinu Abimeleki pamonga na manjolinjoli gaki goha vakawuka kilu na kuhamba ku Shekemu. Akavagava manjolinjoli vaki mumisambi mcheche, na vakajihiha mumigunda yeyavili papipi na Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Gaali mwana wa Ebedi akahuma kuvala na kuyima pa limlyangu la muji, lukumbi lwenulo Abimeleki na vandu vaki vakawuka pandu pavajifiyili. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaali pavaweni vandu avo akamjovela Zebuli, “Lola vandu vihuluka kuhuma kuhituvilu vya hitumbi.” Zebuli akamjovela, “Veve ulola chimuwili cha vitumbi nambu vandu lepi.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gaali akajova kangi, “Lola! Vandu vihuluka pagati ya mulima na msambi wungi uhuma pandi za njila ya mkongo uvaha wa valondola.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Ndi Zebuli akamjovela, “Hinu kuvi kwoki kumeka kwaku, veve mwawajovili, Abimeleki ndi yani? Na ndava kyani timuhengela? Venava lepi vandu vala vewavaligayi? Hamba hinu ukatovana nawu!” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Gaali akawuka kuni akuvalongosa vandu va ku Shekemu kutovana na Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Nambu Gaali ahotwili lepi na kutila kuyingila mu muji, Abimeleki na mwene akatumbula kuvajumbisana na kuvakoma vandu vamahele na mituhi yavi hikadandasika mbaka pa lilyangu la muji. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Kangi Abimeleki akawuya ku Aluma, na Zebuli akamvinga Gaali na valongo vaki vawuka pamuji wa Shekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Chilau yaki, Abimeleki akayuwana kuvya vandu va ku Shekemu vawuki kumuji na kuhamba kumigunda. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Akavatola vandu vaki akavagava mumisambi yidatu, muni vahamba kunyemelela kumigunda. Pevavaweni vandu vihuma kumuji, akahuma pala pevajifiyili vakahamba kuvakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleki na msambi wa manjolinjoli veavii navu vakajumba na kuyima pa limlyangu la muji. Ndava ya ku vadivalila vandu vakotoka kuwuya kubomani. Misambi yaki yivili yeyasigalili yikavahambila vala vevavi kumigunda na kuvakoma voha. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Ngondo yayendalili muhi woha, Abimeleki akautola muji wenuwo na kuvakoma vandu voha vevavili mwenumo. Kangi akabomola nyumba za pa muji na kusopa mwinyu ndima yoha ya muji wenuwo.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Vachilongosi voha vevatamayi ku mnala wa Shekemu pavayuwini makokoso genago, vakatila kuhamba mu nyumba yeyavi na ngomi ya mchapanga weukemiwi Bali Beliti. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleki ajoviwi kuvya vachilongosi voha vevatamayi kumnala wa Shekemu vakonganiki pamonga. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Abimeleki na vandu vaki vakahamba kuchitumbi cha Salimoni, akatola livagu na kudumula limbanda la mkongo na kulivika palivega laki. Kangi akavalagiza vandu vala veavi nawu kanyata vakita ngati chakiti mwene. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Kila mmonga akadumula limbanda ngati lila la Abimeleki. Vakatola mambanda gavi na kugayegeka muluwumba lwa ngomi, vagayocha motu na kutinyisa ngomi, na vandu voha vagosi na vadala elufu yimonga vevavili kumnala wa Shekemu vakafwa.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Kangi Abimeleki akahamba ku Tebesi, akautindila muji wenuwo na kuutola kwa makakala. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Nambu kwavili na mnala waukangamili wewavii pagati ya muji. Hinu vandu voha va muji vagosi na vadala vakatilila mwenumo na kujidindalila mugati. Vakakwela kuchituvilu cha mnala wenuwo. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki na vandu vaki vakahamba pamunala wula muni kuuzangila, na mwene auhegelili mlyangu wa kuyingilila ku mnala muni auyocha motu. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />mdala mmonga akamtagila Abimeleki liganga la kuyagila, likambonda kumutu na kumkayula mutu waki. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Kangi Abimeleki akamkemela kanyata msongolo waki mwagegili vindu vya ngondo akamjovela, “Tola upanga waku unikoma, vandu vakoto kujova kuvya nakomiwi na mdala. Msongolo akatola upanga waki akamuhoma na kumkoma.” <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Vaisilaeli pavaweni kuvya Abimeleki afwili, kila mundu akahamba kunyumba yaki.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Chenicho ndi Chapanga cheambuni Abimeleki kwa uhakau wula weamukitili dadi waki kwa kuvakoma valongo vaki sabini. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Mewawa Chapanga avabunili vandu va ku Shekemu ndava ya uhakau wavi wa kumtangatila Abimeleki. Hinu likoto la Yotamu mwana wa Yelu Baali likavakolela.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Muhamula Tola akuvalongosa Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Peafwili Abimeleki, Tola mwana wa Pau, mjukulu wa Dodo, wa likabila la Isakali, akahumila kuvagombola Vaisilaeli. Tola atamayi ku Shamili ku mulima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Avii muhamula wa Vaisilaeli kwa miyaka ishilini na yidatu, ndi akafwa na kuzikiwa ku Shamili.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhamula Yaili akuvalongosa Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Pafwili Tola akagelekela Yaili mundu wa ku Gileadi akavya muhamula wa Vaisilaeli kwa miyaka ishilini na yivili. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Yaili avili na vana selasini vevakwelili punda selasini, mewawa vavi na miji selasini pamulima wa Gileadi, ndi mbaka lelu hijiji vyenivyo vikemiwa Hawoti Yaili, mana yaki hijiji ya Yaili. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yaili afwili na kuzikwa ku Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhamula Yafuta akuvalongosa Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Vaisilaeli vamuhokili kangi Bambu Chapanga vakavafugamila michapanga ya Baali na michapanga Maashitaloti, na michapanga ya vandu va ku Shamu na michapanga ya vandu va ku Sidoni na michapanga vandu va Amoni na mishapanga ya vandu va ku Filisiti. Vamulekili Bambu Chapanga vamufugamili lepi kangi. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Bambu Chapanga akavayomela Vaisilaeli, na kuvakita Vafilisiti na Vaamoni vavahotola Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Mumiyaka kumi na nane Vaisilaeli vang'ahiswi na Vafilisiti na Vaamoni kwevatamayi kwenuko ku Gileadi kumulima Vaamoli kwelihumila lilanga mwa mfuleni Yolodani. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Vaamoni mewa vayombwiki mfuleni Yoludani kutovana na makabila ga Yuda na makabila ga Benjamini na makabila ga Efulaimu. Hinu vandu va Isilaeli vang'aiswi neju.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Kangi Vaisilaeli vakamvembela Bambu Chapanga na kujova, “Tete tikubudili veve Chapanga, muni tikulekili veve Chapanga witu, na tikuyifugamila michapanga ya Baali.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Mwene Bambu Chapanga akavajovela, “Wu, nene navasangwili lepi kuhuma kwa Vamisili na Vaamoni na Vaamoli na Vafilisiti? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Mewawa Vasidoni na Vaamaleki na Vamidiani vene vavang'aisi, nyenye mwanivembili nene. wu, navasangwili lepi kuhuma muutalalila wavi? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Nambu nyenye munilekili nene na kuyifugamila michapanga yingi. ndava yeniyo yati nikuvasangula lepi kavili. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Hinu muhambayi mukayivembela michapanga yila yemuyihagwili. Yeniyo ndi yivasangula nyenye pamang'aiso ginu.”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Nambu Vaisilaeli vakamjovela Bambu Chapanga, “Tikubudili veve Chapanga. Utihengela chewigana, nambu tikuyupa utisangula lelu.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Kangi vakayitagila kutali michapanga yingi yeyavi pagati yavi vakamfugamila kavili Bambu Chapanga. Mwene Bambu Chapanga aganili lepi kuyendelela kulola Vaizilaeli ving'aiswa.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Ndi Vaamoni vakakonganeka pamonga na kuvika kambi yavi ku Gileadi. Vaisilaeli na vene vakakonganeka pamonga na kuvika kambi yavi ku Misipa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Kwenuko Vaisilaeli na vachilongosi wavi vakakotana, “Hinu ndi yani mweitumbula kutovana ngondo na Vaamoni? Mundu yeyoha mweikita chenicho ndi mweivya chilongosi va vandu voha vevitama ku Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Ku Gileadi avi mundu mkekesi neju liina laki Yefuta, mwana wa mau mmonga mkemi, na dadi waki akemewayi Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Gileadi avi mewa na vana vangi kwa mdala waki wa chakaka. Vana vala pevakulili ndi vakamvinga Yefuta na kumjovela, “Nakuhotola veve kuhala chochoha kuhuma kwa dadi witu, ndava veve wamwana wa mdala yungi.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Hinu Yefuta akavatila valongo vaki akahamba kutama pamulima wa Tobu. Pandu pevitama vandu vangagana kuyidakila malagizu vakajiwunga nayu na kumlanda mulugendu lwaki.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Mwanakandahi, Vaamoni vatovini ngondo na Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Pegahumalili genago, vagogo va ku Gileadi vahambili kumtola Yefuta ku mulima wa Tobu. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Vakamjovela Yefuta, “Ubwela utilongosa patitovana ngondo na Vaamoni.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Nambu Yefuta akavayangula vagogo vala ku Gileadi, “Wu mwemwanibelili nene na kunivinga panyumba ya dadi wangu? Ndava kyani mukunilanda hinu, kuni muvi mumanga'iso?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Vachilongosi va ku Gileadi vakamjovela Yefuta, “Kosewa gamumbele, tete tibwela kwaku muni ukatitangatila kutovana ngondo na Vaamoni, na veve yati uvya chilongosi witu na vandu voha va pa Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefuta akavajovela vagogo va ku Gileadi vala, “Mukaniwuyisayi kunyumba na nyenye mkatovana ngondo na Vaamoni na Bambu Chapanga akanitangatila kuvatova, wu chakaka yati nivya chilongosi winu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Vagogo va ku Gileadi vala vakamjovela Yefuta, “Bambu Chapanga iyuwana goha getijova na tete yati tikita ngati cheujovili.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Yefuta akalandana na vagogo va Gileadi, na vene vamkitili kuvya chilongosi wavi na mkulu wa manjolinjoli. Kwenuko ku Mizipa awuyili kavili kugajova malovi gaki palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga gala goha gealongili na vagogo.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Yefuta avatumili vajumbi kwa nkosi wa ku Amoni vakamjovela, “Uvi na luhonda lwoki na tete mbaka ubwela utovana na vandu va mulima witu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Nkosi wa ku Amoni akavayangula vajumbi vala, “Vaisilaeli pavahumili ku Misili, vatolili mulima wangu kuhuma mfuleni Alinoni mbaka mfuleni Yaboki na mfuleni Yolodani. Hinu niwuyasila mulima wangu kwa uteke.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefuta akatuma kangi vajumbi kwa nkosi wa ku Amoni <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />vakamjovela, “Vaisilaeli vatolili lepi mulima wa Vamoabu amala mulima wa Vaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Nambu Vaisilaeli pevahumili ku Misili vagendili kulukongolo mbaka nyanja ya Shamu na kuhika ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Kangi Vaisilaeli vakatuma vajumbi kwa nkosi wa ku Edomu vakamuyupa vapita pamulima waki, nambu nkosi wa ku Edomu akabela. Ndi vakamuyupa nkosi wa ku Moabu na mwene mewa akabela. Hinu Vaisilaeli vasigalili ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Kangi vagendili kupitila kulugangatu kutindila mulima wa Edomu na Moabu mbaka pavahikili upandi kwelihumila lilanga wa mulima wa Moabu. Kangi vavikili kambi kumwambu ya mfuleni Alinoni. Nambu vayingili lepi kumulima Moabu ndava muni mfuleni Alinoni ndi wavili mmbaka wa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Penapo Vaisilaeli vatumili vajumbi kwa nkosi Sihoni wa Vaamoli mwatalila ku Heshiboni vakamuyupa vapita pamulima waki pevihamba kumulima wavi. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Nambu Sihoni avayidakili lepi Vaisilaeli vapita pamulima waki, ndava muni avasadiki lepi Vaisilaeli na kuvaleka vapitayi. Hinu Sihoni avakonganisi manjolinjoli vaki voha, akavika kambi ku Yahasa, muni vatovana na vandu va Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Vaisilaeli avatangatilia Vaisilaeli vakamtova Sihoni pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki. Hinu Vaisilaeli vatolili mulima woha wa Vaamoli wula wevatamayi. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Vatolili mulima woha wa Vaamoli, kuhumila mfuleni Alinoni mbaka mfuleni Yaboki, mewawa kuhumila lugangatu upandi walihumila lilanga mbaka kwelitipama lilanga mwa mfuleni Yolodani. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Hinu, Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, ndi mweavavingili Vaamoli vawuka palongolo ya Vaisilaeli. Wu, veve ugana kutinyaga mulima witu? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Utola mulima weupewili na mchapanga winu Kemoshi. Nambu tete yati titama mulima wetipewili na Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga witu. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Wu, uholalela kuvya veve unamakakala neju kuliku Balaki mwana wa Zipola mwaavili nkosi wa Moabu? Mwene akomini lepi na Vaisilaeli amala kutovana nawu lukumbi lwoha. <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Ndava muni kwa miyaka miya zidatu Vaisilaeli vatamili ku Heshiboni na hijiji yaki pamonga na miji ya Aloeli na hijiji yaki pamonga na miji yoha yeyivili mumihana ya mfuleni Alinoni, ndava kyani veve watolili lepi ndima yeniyo lukumbi lwenulo? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Nene nikuhokili lepi chochoha nambu veve unihokili kwa kutovana na nene. Bambu Chapanga ndi muhamula lelu ahamula pagati ya Vaisilaeli na vandu va Amoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Nambu nkosi wa Amoni avevisi ujumbi wenuwo wa Yefuta.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Kangi Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga wamuhambili Yefuta, na mwene akawuka na kupita pagati ya Gileadi na Manase, akawuya Mizipa pa mulima wa Gileadi na kuvazangila Vaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefuta akamlapila Bambu Chapanga akajova, “Ngati ukanikita nivahotola Vaamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />hinu yeyoha mwaihuma kuvala ya nyumba yangu kubwela kunipokela penivya mukuwuya penimali kuvatova Vaamoni, mwenuyo yati ivya waku veve Bambu Chapanga. Mwenuyo yati nikuwusila kuvya luteta lwa kutinyisa.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Hinu, Yefuta akayomboka mfuleni, akahamba kutovana na Vaamoni na Bambu Chapanga akamtagatila Yefuta avahotola Vaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Yefuta na manjolinjoli vaki vavahotwili neju, akatola kutumbula Aloeli mbaka papipi na Miniti na kuyendelela mbaka Abeli Kelamimu, miji yoha yeyatoviwi yavili ishilini. Hinu Vaizilaeli vavahotwili jwee Vaamoni.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msikana wa Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Yefuta pavili mukuwuya kunyumba yaki ku Mizipa, msikana waki akahuma kuvala kumpokela kuni ikina na kutova kang'oma. Msikana mwenuyo ndi avili mwana yuyo avi lepi na mwana yungi wa chidala amala mgosi. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Yefuta pamuweni, apapwile nyula zaki kwa ungolongondi na kujova, “Vee msikana wangu! Univinisi mtima. Veve ndi mmonga wa vandu vevakuning'aha. Nilapili kwa Bambu Chapanga ndi nihotola lepi kung'anamusa chila chenilapili.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Na mwene akamjovela, “Dadi ngati ulapili chindu kwa Bambu Chapanga, ndi kita chila chewahadili, ndava Bambu Chapanga akutangatili kuvatova Vaamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Kangi akamjovela dadi waki, “Nikuyupa chindu chimonga, nipela miyehi hivili nihamba na vamkozi vangu kuchitumbi, kuvembenekela lifwa langu muni yati nifwa kwakona nangagegewa.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Dadi waki akamleka ahamba kwenuko kwa miyehi yivili. Mwene akahamba pamonga na vamkozi vaki, na kuvembeneka ndava yati ifwa kwakona angagegewa. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Payamaliki miyehi yivili, akawuya kwa dadi waki, na dadi waki akamkitila ngati cheahadili. Msikana mwenuyo agonili lepi na mgosi yoyoha. Ndi kuhumila penapo vakavika mvelu wenuwo ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Kila mwaka vasikana va Isilaeli vahamba kuvembeneka kwa magono mcheche ndava ya lifwa la msikana wa Yefuta wa ku Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Yefuta itovana na vandu va likabila la Efulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Manjolinjoli va likabila la Efulaimu vakonganiki kujitendelekela ndava ya ngondo, vakayomboka mfuleni Yolodani vakahika ku Zafoni. Kangi vakamjovela Yefuta, “Ndava kyani watikemili lepi tihamba pamonga kutovana na Vaamoni? Hinu yati tiyocha nyumba yaku kuni veve uvii mugati yaki!”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yefuta akavajovela, “Nene pamonga na vandu vangu tavii na umakoko uvaha na Vaamoni. Navayupili munitangatila nambu mwabwelili lepi kunisangula. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Panalolili kuvya mbwelili lepi kunisangula, nayokisi wumi wangu, nahambili kukomana na Vaamoni na Bambu Chapanga anitangatili nikavatova. Ndava kyani hinu mbwelili kutovana na nene?” <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Penapo Yefuta akavakemela vandu voha va ku Gileadi pamonga, vakahamba kutovana na vandu va Efulaimu. Vandu venavo va Geleadi vavahotwili vandu va Efulaimu. Venavo Vaefulaimu ndi vevavajovayi, “Nyenye va Gileadi ndi vatolo vemjumbili kuhuma likabila la Efulaimu na Manase.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Kangi vandu va Geliadi vakanyaga viyombokelu vya mfuleni Yolodani muni mundu yoyoha kuhuma mulikabila la Geliadi akotoka kuyomboka. Mundu yoyoha mweaganayi kuyomboka ndava ya kutila ngondo vandu va Geliadi vakamukota, “Wu, veve uhuma mulikabila la Efulaimu?” Na ngati akayangula, “Pehe,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />Vamjovili, hinu jova linenu lenili, “Shiboleti” Nambu mwene akajova, “Siboleti,” Ndava muni va Efulaimu vahotola lepi kuluwula bwina linenu lenilo. Penapo vakumkamula na kumkoma kwenuko kuviyombokelu vya mfuleni Yolodani. Vandu alufu alubaini na vavili va Efulaimu vafwili lukumbi lwelulo.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefuta avili muhamula wa Vaisilaeli kwa miyaka sita. Kangi Yefuta mundu kuhuma ku Geleadi akafwa, vamzikili ku Geleadi, pa muji waki.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahamula Ibizani na Eloni na Abidoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Peafwili Yefuta, Ibizani mundu kuhuma ku Betelehemu akavya chilongosi na muhamula wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Mwene avili na vana vagosi selasini na vasikana selasini. Vasikana vaki selasini avagegisi kulukolo lungi, mewawa na vasongolo vaki vagegili vasikana selasini kuhuma lukolo lungi. Ibizani avili muhamula wa Isilaeli kwa miyaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Kangi Ibizani afwili, vakamzika ku muji wa Betelehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Mewawa peafwili Ibizani, Eloni wa likabila la Zebuluni avili muhamula wa Isilaeli kwa miyaka kumi. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Kangi Eloni akafwa, vakamzika ku muji wa Aiyaloni kumulima wa likabila la Zebuluni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Peafwili Eloni, Abudoni mwana wa Hileli, kuhuma ku muji wa Pilatoni akavya muhamula wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Abudoni avili na vana vagosi alubaini na vajukulu selasini vevakwelili punda sabini. Na mwene avili muhamula wa Isilaeli kwa miyaka nane. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Kangi Abudoni afwili, vamzikili ku muji wa Pilatoni pamulima wa likabila la Efulaimu, pa mulima wa hitumbi ya Vaamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Kuvelekewa kwa Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Vaisilaeli vahengili kangi uhakau palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, na mwene akavaleka vatalaliwa na Vafilisiti kwa miyaka alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Kwavili na mundu mmonga ku Sola uko, wa likabila la Dani, lihina laki Manoa. Na mdala waki avili ngaveleka. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Ligono limonga, mtumu wa Bambu Chapanga amuhumalili mdala mwenuyo akamjovela, “Veve ndi ngaveleka, nambu yati wipata ndumbu na kumveleka mwana wa chigosi. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Hinu ujiyangalila, kotoka kunywa divayi amala ugimbi amala kotoka kulya chakulya chochoha chechikukita ukotoka kuyidikiliwa na Chapanga, <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />muni yati uvya na ndumbu na kumveleka mwana mgosi. Mayunju ga mwana mwenuyo gakotoka kuketwa, muni mwana mwenuyo avaguliwi ndava ya Chapanga, muni yati ivya ndava ya lihengu la Chapanga kuhumila kuvelekewa kwaki. Na mwene yati itumbula kuvasangula Vaisilaeli kuhuma kwa Vafilisiti.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Mdala mwenuyo akahamba kumjovela mngana waki, “Mundu wa Chapanga anibwelili ndi pamihu paki pavili ngati mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga. Nayogwipi neju, namkoti lepi kwahumili mewa namkoti lepi lihina laki. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Nambu anijovili kuvya yati nivya na ndumbu na kuveleka mwana mgosi. Anilagizi nikotoka kunywa divayi amala ugimbi mewa nikotoka kulya chochoha chechikunikita nikoto kuyidakiliwa na Chapanga, muni mwana mwenuyo avya mweavaguliwi ndava ya Chapanga na awusiwi ndava ya lihengu la Chapanga kuhumila kuvelekewa mbaka peifwa.”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Ndi Manoa akamyupa Bambu Chapanga akajova, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, pepayi, nikuyupa umtuma kangi mundu waku yula mwawamtumili muni atiwula gala getiganikiwa kumhengela mwana mwenuyo peivelekewa.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Bambu Chapanga ayuwini kuyupa kwa Manoa, na mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga yula amuhambili kangi mdala yula pavili kumgunda. Nambu mngana waki avi lepi pamonga nayu. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Ndi mdala yula akajumba kanyata, kumjovela mngana waki, “Lola! Mundu yula mwanihumalili ligono lila anihumali kangi.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa akalandana na mdala waki mbaka kwa mundu yula, akamkota, “Wu, veve ndi mundu yula mwawalongili na mdala mwenuyu?” Mundu yula akamyangula, “Ena, ndi nene.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Kangi Manoa akamkota, “Lukumbi malovi gaku pegitimila ndi mambu goki getiganikiwa kugalanda ndava ya mwana mwenuyo? Yati ihenga lihengu loki?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Mtumu wa kunani wa Bambu akamjovela Manoa, “Mdala waku iganikiwa kukamula goha genimujovili. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Akotoka kulya chochoha chechihengiwi kuhuma muzabibu, mewa akotoka kunywa divayi amala ugimbi amala kulya chochoha changayidikiliwa palongolo ya Chapanga. Agalanda goha genimlagizi.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa akamjovela mtumu mwenuyo, “Pepayi tama chidogo tikuhinjila mene ulye.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamjovela Manoa, “Hati ngati mkaning'ang'anisa nitama chidogo yati nilya lepi chakulya chinu. Nambu ukagana, tendekeha luteta lwa kutinyisa, umuwusila Bambu.” Manoa amanyili lepi kuvya mwenuyo ndi mtumu wa Bambu.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Hinu, Manoa akamjovela mtumu wa Bambu yula, “Tijovela lihina laku muni gala gewatijovili pegitimila tikutopesa.”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamyangula, “Ndava kyani ugana kumanya lihina langu? Lihina langu likangasa.”<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Penapo Manoa akatendekeha mwana mene na luteta lwa uhembe akavika panani ya litalahu akumuwusila Bambu Chapanga. Na mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga yula akakita mambu ga kukangasa palongolo ya Manoa na mdala waki. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Hinu, Manoa na mdala waki pavavili vilola milumuli ya motu chayikwela kunani kuhuma pandu pakuwusila luteta, vamuweni mtumu mwenuyo wa Bambu Chapanga mumilumuli yila ikwela kuhamba kunani, ndi Manoa na mdala waki vakamfugamila. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Manoa akamanya kuvya mwenuyo avii mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga. Mtumu mwenuyo wa Bambu amuhumalili lepi kangi Manoa amala mdala waki.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Hinu manoa akmjovela mdala waki, “Chakaka yati tifwa, muni timuweni Chapanga!”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Nambu mdala waki akamyangula, “Ngati Bambu Chapanga ngaigana kutikoma ngayidakili lepi luteta lwitu lwa kutinyisa na luteta lwa uhembe, na ngatilangisi lepi mambu ago mewa na kutipela malagizu.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Hinu, mdala wa Manoa aveliki mwana mgosi, na mwene akampela lihina Samsoni. Mwana mwenuyo akakula na Bambu Chapanga ammotisi. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Mpungu wa Bambu ukatumbula kuhenga lihengu mugati yaki peavili ku Mahane Dani, pagati ya ku Sola na ku Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni na mdala wa kuhuma ku Timna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Ligono limonga Samsoni ahelili kuhamba ku muji weukemiwa Timna, kwenuko amuwene mdala mmonga Mfilisiti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Peawuyili kunyumba akavajovela mau na dadi waki, “Nimuweni mdala mmonga mfilisiti ku Timna. Hinu munigegesa mdala mwenuyo.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Nambu dadi na nyina waki vakamkota, “Wu, kawaka msikana yoyoha pagati ya valongo vaku amala pagati ya vandu vitu hati uhamba kugega kwa vafilisiti vangadumula jandu?” Nambu Samsoni akamjovela dadi waki, “Nigegesa mdala mwenuyo, muni akuniganisa neju.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Dadi na nyina waki vamanyili lepi kuvya mambu genagu gakitiwi na Bambu mwene ndava ya kuvatova Vafilisiti. Lukumbi lwenulo, Vafilisiti vavatalalila Vaisilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Samsoni na dadi na nyina waki vawukili kuhamba ku Timna. Pavahikili kumigunda ya mizabibu uko ku Timna, chigafula ukahumalila mpapakasi ukali wa lihimba na ukambulumila Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Bahopo, mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga wamuyingili Samsoni kwa makakala, akalikamula milomo na kulikayulana lihimba lila kwa mawoko gaki ngati mundu chaikayulana mene. Nambu Samsoni avajovili lepi dadi amala nyina waki lijambu leakitili.<verse eid="JDG 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Samsoni pahikili ku Timna, akahamba kulongela na msikana yula mweamganisi neju Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Magono gadebe pagapitili akawuya kangi ku Timna kuhamba kumgega msikana yula. Peavili mnjila akaveduka pamuhana ya njila kulola mtuhi wa lihimba wula, kumbi kwavili na njuchi na wuchi mumtuhi wula. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Ndi, akabakula wuchi wula kwa mawoko gaki akavya ilya kuni iyendelela na lugendu lwaki. Pawuyili kwa dadi na nyina waki akavapela wuchi na vene vakalya. Nambu avajovili lepi kuvya wuchi wula wahumi mugati ya mtuhi wa lihimba.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Dadi waki Samsoni akahamba kunyumba ya msikana mwenuyo kuvika bwina mambu ga kugegana, na Samsoni akakita mselebuko kwenuko ngati chavakitayi vasongolo. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Vafilisiti pavamuweni Samsoni vamuletili vasongolo selasini vatama nayu pamuselebuko wenuwo. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samsoni akavajovela, “Yati nikita luhumu. Ngati mukahotola kudandawula luhumu lwenulo mulukumbi lwa magono saba ga mselebuko, yati nikuvapela magwanda selasini gamsopi neju na magwanda gangi selasini.” <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Nambu ngati muhotwili lepi kudandawula, nyenye yati mukunipela magwanda selasini gamsopi neju na magwanda gangi selasini.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">“Vakamjovela, Tijovela luhumu lwenulo tiyuwane.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Samsoni akavajovela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Mugati ya mweilya kwahumili chakulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">mgati ya mweanamakakala chahumili chindu chechinoga.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Mumagono gadatu vasongolo vala vahotwili lepi kudandawula luhumu lula.”<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Hinu ligono la mcheche vakamjovela mdala wa Samsoni, “Myupa mngana waku atidandaulila mana ya luhumu lwenulo, ngati lepi yati tikuyocha motu veve na pamonga nyumba ya dadi waku. Wu mwatigongolili penapa ndava ya kutinyaga vindu vitu?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Mdala wa Samsoni amuhambili Samsoni kuni ivemba, akamjovela, “Chakaka unigani lepi! Uvapelili luhumu vandu vangu nambu unidandaulili lepi!” Samsoni akamyangula, “yuwanila hati dadi na nyina wangu navajovili lepi, hinu nihotola wuli kukujovela veve?”<verse eid="JDG 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Nambu ayendelili kuvemba mumagono goha saba ga mselebuko. Muligono la saba Samsoni amjovili mdala waki mana ya luhumu lula muni amung'ahayi. Mdala waki akahamba kanyata kuvajovela vandu vaki mana ya luhumu lwenulo. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Ligono lenilo la saba, kwakona lilanga kutipama vakamjovela Samsoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Chindu choki chechinoga kuliku wuchi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Ndi yani mwana makakala kuliku lihimba?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:18">Samsoni akavayangula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Ngati ngamuleke kumkulukisa mdala wangu anikota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">ngamumanyi lepi udandaulo wa luhumu lwangu.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Penapo mpungu wa Bambu wamukitili Samsoni avya na makakala, ndi akahamba ku Ashikeloni, akavakoma vandu selasini, kangi akatola magwanda gavi ga mselebuko akavapela vala vavahotwili luhumu lula. Kangi akawuya kunyumba ya dadi na nyina waki kuni ayomi neju. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Hinu, mdala wa Samsoni agotoliwi kwa msongolo mmonga mweavii mkozi wa Samsani pagati ya vala selasini vevabwelili kutama nayu.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Pegapitili magono gamahele, lukumbi lwa mabenu ga nganu, Samsoni atolili mwana mene akahamba kumgendelela mdala waki. Akamjovela mkohanu wa chigosi, “Nigana kumlola mdala wangu kuchumba chaki.” Nambu mkohanu waki akambelelela.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Mkohanu waki akamjovela, “Naholalili pangi umganili lepi ndi nimgegisi mkozi waku amgega. Nambu avi mbena waki, ndi anyambi kuliku mwene. Pepayi mgega mwenuyo pahala yaki.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samsoni akamjovela, “Lukumbi ulu mkotoka kujova kuvya nihengili lepi gabwina kwa gala genikuvakitila Vafilisiti!” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Hinu Samsoni akahamba kukamula mabweha miya zidatu na kukunga mikila yaki gaviligavili, kangi akavika chisindi cha moto mukila mabweha gavili. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Kangi akachonja milumuli yila na kugalekekeha mabweha gala, nagene gakayingila mumigunda ya Vafilisiti, gakayocha makinja ga nganu na nganu yeyavili yakona kubenwa, mewewa gakatinyisi na migunda ya mizeituni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Vafilisiti peavakotili yani mweakitili chenicho, vakamanya kuvya Samsoni ndi mwakitili chenicho ndava ya mkohanu waki wa ku Timna, mkohanu waki amtolili mdala wa Samsoni na kumgegesa mkozi waki. Hinu Vafilisiti vakahamba kumuyocha motu mdala yula na dadi waki.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samsoni akavajovela Vafilisiti, “Ngati genago ndi gamkitili! Nilapa yati niwuka lepi mbaka nivalipisa kwa gala gemuhengili!” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Hinu, akavazangila neju na kuvakoma vamahele. Kangi akahamba kutama mumbugu ya litalau ku Etamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni akuvahotola Vafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Kangi Vafilisiti vakabwela, vakavika kambi yavi pamulima wa Yuda na kuuzangila muji wa Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Vandu va ku Yuda vakavakota, “Ndava kyani mbwelili kutizangila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Na vene vakavayangula, “Tibwelili kumkamula Samsoni na kumuhengela ngati cheatihengili.”<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Hinu, vandu alufu zidatu va ku Yuda vamuhambili Samsoni kumbugu ya ku Etamu vakamjovela, “Wu, umanyili lepi kuvya Vafilisiti vakutitalalila? Utihengili kyani?” Samsoni akavayangula, “Nivahengili chila chevanihengili vene.” <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Vakamjovela, “Tibweli kukukamula na kukupeleka kwavi.” Samsoni akavajovela, “Munilapila kuvya mwavene yati mukunikoma lepi.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Vene vakamjovela, “Tete yati tikukoma lepi yati tikukunga ndu na kukugotola kwavi.” Ndi vakamkunga kwa nyosi zivili zamupya na kumuhumisa mumbugu yila.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Pahikili ku Lehi, Vafilisiti vamuhambili mbiyo kuni viywanga. Chigafula mpungu wa Bambu wamuyingili Samsoni kwa makakala na nyosi zila zevamukungili mumawoko zadaukini ngati wuzi cheuyaka motu na kugwa pahi. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Samsoni akalokota njege yivisi ya punda, njege yeniyo ahengili kuvakoma vandu alufu yimonga. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Ndi Samsoni akajova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kwa njege ya punda nikomili vandu alufu yimonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">Kwa njege ya punda niyolili malundu ga mituhi.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Peamali kujova, akataga njege yila. Pandu pala pakemiwi Lamati Lehi, mana yaki chitumbi cha njege.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Kangi Samsoni avili na njota, akayupa, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, ndi mweunitangatili kupata uhotola uwu, kwa kunihengela nene mtumisi waku, hinu yati ukunileka nifwayi na njota na kukamuliwa na Vafilisiti ava vangadumula jandu?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Chapanga akakayula pandu pepavili na lilindi ku Leki akahumisa manji. Samsoni akanywa manji gala akavya na makakala kangi. Chinyepa chenicho chakemiwi Eni Hakole ndi chivi ku Lehi mbaka lelu.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samsoni avili muhamula wa Vaisilaeli kwa miyaka ishilini, nambu Vafilisiti vavii vakona vitalalila pa Isilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni kumuji wa ku Gaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Ligono limonga Samsoni ahambili kumuji wa ku Gaza, kwenuko akonganike na mdala mmonga mkemi akagona nayu. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Vandu va ku Gaza pavajoviwi kuvya Samsoni avi kwenuko, vatindili pandu apo kumbajamila pa limlyangu la muji kilu yoha mbaka lukela. Vatamili nuu kwenuko kilu yoha muni vajovili yati tikumkoma lukela. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Nambu Samsoni agonili kwenuko mbaka pagati ya kilu. Kilu yiyo ayimwiki na kuhamba kulimlyangu la muji. Kwenuko akalitupula limulyangu loha pamonga na vidindilu vyaki akagega mumavega gaki na kuhamba nalu mbaka kuchitumbi chechivii papipi na Hebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni na Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Pegamaliki genago, Samsoni amganili mdala yungi mweikemiwa Delila mwatamayi kulikemba la Soleki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Vachilongosi va Vafilisiti vakamuhambila Delila yula na kumujovela, “Umubembelezayi Samsoni muni uhotola kumanya makakala gaki gahumalili kwoki na namuna chetihotola kumukamula na kumukunga. Na tete kila mumonga witu yati akukupela hipandi elufu yimonga na miya yimonga ya madini ga feza.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Delila amjovili Samsoni, “Pepayi, nijovela makakala gaku gihumalila kwoki, na mundu ihotola wuli kukuhotola na kukukunga?”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samsoni akayangula, “Vakanikunga kwa nyosi saba zivisi za upindi wa nduta, penapo yati nivya lepi na makakala ngati mundu yungi yoyoha.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Vakulu va Vafilisiti vamletili Delila nyosi saba zivisi za upinde, na mwene akamkunga Samsoni kwa nyosi zenizo. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delila avahihili manjolinjoli muchumba chingi vamnyemelela Samsoni, kangi akamkemela Samsoni kwa lwami luvaha, “Samsoni, manjolinjoli va Vafilisiti vabwelili kukuzangila!” Nambu Samsoni akadawula nyosi zila zeakungiwi mumawoko ngati wuzi chautinyika motu. Hinu kawaka mundu mweamanyili kuvya makakala gaki gihumila kwoki.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila akamjovela Samsoni, “Veve univevisi na unikongili. Pepayi niyupa unijovela mundu chaihotola kukukunga kwa chindu kiki.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samsoni akamyangula, “Vakanikunga kwa nyosi za mupya zangahengewa lihengu loloha penapo yati nivya nangali makakala ngati mundu yungi yoyoha.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Hinu, Delila akatola nyosi zamupya akamkunga. Kangi akamjovela Samsoni kwa lwami luvaha, “Vafilisiti vabwelili kukuzangila!” Penapo kwavili na manjolinjoli kuchumba chingi vakumnyemelela. Nambu Samsoni akazidawula nyosi zila zeakungiwi mumawoko gaki ngati wuzi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila akamjovela Samsoni, “Mbaka hinu wakona ukunikonga ugani lepi kunijovela uchakaka. Nijovela mundu chaihotola kukukunga.” Samsoni akamyangula, “Ukabota mayunju gangu gavya mubutu saba na kukungisa pamonga muchitambala, na kukunga mulitendegu yati nivya nangali makakala ngati mundu yungi yoyoha.”<verse eid="JDG 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Samsoni pagonili, Delila abotili mabutu saba ga mayunju ga Samsoni pamonga na chitambala na kukunga mulitendegu. Kangi akamjovela Samsoni, “Samsoni manjolinjoli ga Vafilisiti vibwela kukuzangila.” Samsoni akayimuka kuhuma mulugono akatupula litendegu lila na kupapula chitambala chila.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Delila akamjovela Samsoni, “Uhotola wuli kujova uniganili kuni ulangisa uniganili lepi kwa kunikonga? Univevisi mala zidatu, unijovili lepi kuvya makakala gaku gihumila kwoki.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Delila ayendalili kumng'aha Samsoni kwa kumujovela mambu genago magono goha. Ndi Samsoni akatotokela neju na aganili lepi kangi kukotwa kotwa ndava ya lijambu lenilo, <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />pamwisu akamujovela uchakaka, akajova, “Katu mayunju gangu gawahi lepi kuketwa, nene nivaguliwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga kuhumila panavili mulutumbu lwa nyina wangu. Ngati vakaniketa mayunju gangu makakala gangu yati giwuka, ndi yati nivya ngati vandu vangi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Hinu, Delila palolili kuvya Samsoni amjovili mfiyu wa makakala gaki, akavakemela vakulu va Vafilisiti, akavajovela, “Mbwela kangi muni Samsoni anijovi mfiyu waki woha, penapo vakulu va Vafilisiti vakamuhambila Delila kuni vamugegili vipandi vya madini ga feza ngati chevamujovili.” <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Hinu Delila akamkita Samsoni agona pa mawondo gaki, akamkemela mundu amketa mabutu saba gala. Kangi Delila akatumbula kumng'aha Samsoni muni makakala gaki gamuwukili. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Delila akamjovela, Samsoni, “Samsoni manjolinjoli ga Vafilisiti vibwela kukuzangila!” Samsoni akayimuka mulugono kuni iholalela ngati ihuma na kujisangula ngati cheikitaga. Kumbi amanyili lepi kuvya Bambu Chapanga amali kumleka. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Vafilisiti vakamkamula Samsoni, vakamkoyola mihu na kumpeleka kumuji wa ku Gaza, vamkungili kwa pingu za shaba na kumsopa muchifungu, na kwenuko vakampela lihengu la kuyaga nganu. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Nambu mayunju ga Samsoni gakatumbula kumela na kukula kavili.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifwa la Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Vakulu va Vafilisiti vakonganike ndava ya kuselebuka na kumuwusila luteta chapanga wavi mwaikemiwa Dagoni. Hinu vakavya viyimba naha, “Hinu chapanga witu atitangatili kumkamula likoko witu Samsoni.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Vandu pevamanyili gegamkolili Samsoni, vakamlumba chapanga wavi na kujova, “Hinu chapanga witu atitangatili kumkamula likoko witu mweahalabisi mlima witu na kukoma vandu vitu vamahele.” <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Vandu pevahekalili neju mumitima yavi, vakajova, “Mumleta Samsoni abwela kukina.” Hinu vamuwusili Samsoni muchifungu, na mwene akakina palongolo yavi vakamvika ayima pagati ya nguzo zivili. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samsoni amjovili msongolo mwamlongosa, “Nivika pandu penihotola kupamisa nguzo zezikamulili lijengu ili muni na nene niyegemela.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Nyumba yeniyo yavili yimemili vandu vagosi na vadala. Vachilongosi va Vafilisiti vavili mwenumo, na kudali ya nyumba yeniyo kwavili na vandu alufu zidatu vagosi na vadala, vandu voha vamulingulilayi Samsoni cheakuvahekesa.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Penapo Samsoni akamuyupa Bambu Chapanga, “Chondi Bambu Chapanga, nikuyupa unikumbuka. Nipela makakala mala yimonga ndu veve Chapanga wangu muni nivalipisa Vafilisiti, ndava ya kukoyola mihu gangu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Hinu, Samsoni akamwili nguzo zivili za pagati zezakamulili nyumba yoha, chiwoko chimonga munguzo yimonga na chingi nguzo yingi. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Kangi Samsoni akajova, “Nifwayi pamonga na Vafilisiti!” Akakang'a nguzo zila kwa makakala gaki goha, nyumba yavagwilili vakulu voha va Vafilisiti na vandu voha vevavili mugati. Penapo veavakomili lukumbi lwa lifwa laki vavili vamahele neju ya vala veavakomili peavili mumi.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Valongo vaki vabwelili kumtola, vamzikili pagati ya muji wa Sola na muji wa Eshitaoli mulitinda la Manoa, dadi waki. Samsoni avili muhamula wa Isilaeli kwa miyaka ishilini.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Chimong'ong'o cha Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo kwavili na mundu mmonga lihina laki Mika, mweatamayi kuhitumbi ya mulima Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Ligono limonga amjovili nyina waki, “Wu, ukumbuka hipandi elufu yimonga na miya yimonga ya madini ga feza vyawayiviwi? Nene navili na nayuwini chawampela likoto mundu mweakuyivili, nene nivi navyu na ndi mwenakuyivili.” Nyina waki akajova, “Wa mwana wangu umotisiwa na Bambu Chapanga!”<verse eid="JDG 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Mika akamuwuyasila nyina waki hipandi alufu yimonga na miya yimonga ya madini ga feza. Nyina waki akajova, “Muni likoto ili likotoka kukupata, vipandi vyenivi vya feza nikuviwusa kwa Bambu Chapanga muni titengeneza chimong'omong'o cha kuhongola na kugubikwa kwa madini ga feza. Hinu nene nikuwuyasila vipandi vyenivi vya feza.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Mika pamuwuyasile nyina waki ipandi ya madini ga feza gala, nyina waki akatola vipandi miya zivili akampela mwaikita lufumbu na mwene akatengeneza chimong'omong'o cha kuhongola na kuchigubika kwa madini ga feza. Chimong'omong'o chenicho akachivika mugati ya nyumba ya Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Hinu Mika avili na pandu paki pakumyupila Chapanga. Atenganize kagwanda ka panganga ka mteta na vimong'omong'o, kangi akamkita mmonga wa vana vaki kuvya mteta waki. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Lukumbi lwenulo kwavili lepi na nkosi ku Isilaeli. Kila mundu akitili chochoha chawonili chabwina.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Lukumbi lwenulo kwavili na msongolo mmonga mweatamayi kumuji wa Betelehemu ku mulima wa Yuda, mundu mwenuyo avii Mlawiwa likabila la Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Msongolo mwenuyo awukili ku Betelehemu na kuhamba kulonda pandu pangi pa kutama. Mulugendu lwaki ahikili kunyumba ya Mika kumulima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika akamkota, “Uhumili kwoki?” Mwene akamyangula, Nene Mlawi kuhuma kumuji wa Betelehemu mulima wa Yuda. “Nilonda pandu pa kutama.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika akamjovela, “Tama pamonga na nene, muni uvya ngati mshauli na mteta wangu. Yati nikupela hipandi kumi ya madini ga feza kila mwaka na nyula pamonga na chakulya.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Mlawi yula akayidakila kutama na Mika, na kuvya ngati mmonga wa vana vaki. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Hinu Mika akamkita Mlawi yula kuvya mteta waki na kutama kunyumba yaki. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Kangi Mika akajova, “Hinu nimanyili kuvya Bambu Chapanga yati ikita mambu gangu gakitika bwina muni nivi na msongolo uyu Mlawi ngati mteta wangu.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Mika na likabila la Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Magono genago Vaisilaeli vavi lepi na nkosi. Hinu likabila la Dani lalondayi pandu pavi pene pa kutama penapo, muni mbaka lukumbi lwenulo lavii lakona na kunukuliwa pandu paki pagati ya makabila ga Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Hinu vandu va likabila la Dani vavatumili vandu mhanu vanamakakala kuhuma ku Sola na ku Eshitaoli vakavalagiza vahamba vaung'omesa mulima. Hinu vandu venavo vakahika pamulima wa vitumbi vya Efulaimu, vakatama ku nyumba ya Mika. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Pevavili ku nyumba ya Mika, vamanyili chailongela msongolo Mlawi yula, ndi vakayingila mugati na kumkota, “Ndi yani mweakuletili kuni? Penapa wikita kyani?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Mwene akavayangula, “Niyidakilini na Mika mweanilipa nimuhengela lihengu la kuvya mteta namteta waki.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Vakamjovela, “Pepayi, utikotekesela kwa Bambu Chapanga ngati mu lugendu lwitu yati tipata chatigana.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Mteta yula akavayangula, “Mhamba wa uteke. Bambu Chapanga aluyidakili lugendu lwinu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Hinu vandu mhanu vala vakawuka na kuhamba ku Laishi. Vavawene vandu vevatamili kwenuko, chevatamili kwa uteke ngati vandu va ku Sidoni. Vandu venavo vakomana lepi na mundu na vavi na kila chindu pamulima wavi. Mewa vavii kutali na vandu va ku Sidoni na vajibagwili na vandu vangi. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Vamang'omesi vala vawuyili kwa valongo vavi ku Sola na ku Eshitaoli, valongo vavi vakavakota, “Mambu mugawene wuli kwenuko?” <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Vene vakavayangula, “Muyima na tihamba tikauzangila mulima wenuo. Tiuweni mulima wenuo una ludaka lwa bwina kwa kugaba, wu, yati mtama penapa changali kukita chindu? Mkita kanyata kuhamba kuutola mulima wenuo! <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Pamuhika kwenuko yati mukuvakolela vandu vangali wogoyu wowoha. Mulima wenuwo uvaha na uvi na kila chindu chetigana kwa wumi witu, na Chapanga atipeli mulima wenuwo uvya witu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Hinu, vandu miya sita kuhuma likabila la Dani vavi na silaha zavi za ngondo vakawuka kuhuma Sola na Eshitaoli kuhamba kutova ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Pavavili mulugendu vakavika kambi ku Kiliati Yealimu pamulima wa Yuda. Ndava yeniyo pandu penapo upandi wa kwalitipama lilanga pikemiwa Mahane Dani mbaka lelu. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Kuhuma kwenuko vakahamba mulima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu, vakahika kunyumba ya Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Vandu vala vevakiti umang'omesi ku mulima wa Laishi vakavajovela valongo vavi, “Wu, mmanyili kuvya munyumba zenizi kuvi na chizibau na vimong'omong'o vya michapanga pamonga na chimong'omong'o cha kuhongola na kugubikwa kwa madini ga feza? Hinu muholalela chakukita.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Hinu vamang'omesi vala vakahamba kunyumba ya Mika, vakayingila na kumjambusa msongolo iyendelela wuli. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Lukumbi lwenulo manjolinjoli vala miya sita va likabila la Dani, pevavi na vindu vyavi vya ngondo, vayimili palimlyangu. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Manjolinjoli muhanu vala vevahambili kukita umang'omesi pamulima vayingili mugati, vatolili chimong'omong'o chachigubikwi na madini ga feza, chizibau na vimong'omong'o vingi vya michapanga. Lukumbi lwenulo mteta yula ayimili pamlyangu pamonga na vandu miya sita vevakamwili vindu vya ngondo.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Peavaweni vandu vala vayingi munyumba ya Mika vakatola chimong'omong'o cha kuhongola na chechigubikwi kwa madini ga feza na kahaku ka panganga, akavakota, “Mkita kyani?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Vakamjovela, “Guna, kotoka kujova chindu chochoha, tiwuka tavoha uvya mteta witu na dadi witu. Wu, chabwina veve kuvya mteta wa mundu mmonga amala kuvya mteta wa likabila limonga la Isilaeli?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Mteta yula ahekalili neju akatola kizibau na chimong'omong'o cha kuhongola na kugubikwa na madini ga feza na akalandana nawu.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Hinu, vakatumbula lugendu kuni valongolisi vana vavi na mifuya na vindu vyavi vyoha. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Pavahiki kutali na nyumba yila, Mika akavakemela vandu vevatamayi papipi na mwene, vakavalanda vandu va likabila la Dani vakavakolela, <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />vakalongela kwa lwami luvaha, na vandu va likabila la Dani vakang'anamuka, na vakamkota Mika, “Ugana kyani mbaka utilandili pamonga na msambi wenuwo woha?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika akavayangula, “Nyenye mtolili michapanga yangu yanajitengenezili, na mumtolili na mteta wangu muwukili nayu, munilekili changali chindu. Muhotola wuli kunikota nigana kyani?”<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Vandu va likabila la Dani vakamyangula, “Kotoka kujova na tete, ngati lepi vavi vandu vangi pagati yitu vana ligoga vihotola kukuzangila, na veve yati uyagisa wumi waku na wa valongo vaku.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Mika pealolili kuvya vandu vala vana makakala kuliku mwene, akawuya kunyumba, na vala vandu va likabila la Dani vakayendelela na lugendu.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Vandu va likabila la Dani vala vakatola vindu vyevyatenganizwi na Mika, vakamtola na mteta mwamuhengela. Vakahamba kuvazangila vandu va kumuji Laishi vevatamayi kwa uteke, vakavakoma vandu va muji wenuwo kwa mapanga gavi na kuutinyisa muji wenuwo woha. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Vandu va muji wenuwo vavi lepi na mundu wa kuvasangula muni vavi kutali na muji wa Sidoni, na vayelewana lepi na vandu vangi. Muji wenuwo wavili mulikemba la Beti Lehobu. Vandu va likabila la Dani vaujengili kangi muji wenuwo na kutama mwenumo. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Vang'anamwisi lihina la muji wenuwo, vakaukemela Dani lihina la gogo wavi mweavili mmonga wa vana va Yakobo. Pakutumbula apo muji wenuwo wakemiwi Laishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Vandu va likabila la Dani vayimamisi chimong'omong'omo na kuchifugamila, na Yonatani mwana wa Gelishomu, mjukulu wa Musa, avili mteta wavi. Vavelekwa vaki mewa vavili vamteta va likabila la Dani mbaka vandu va mulima wenuwo pevapelikwi kuluhamilu. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Lukumbi lwoha Lindanda la Chapanga lelavili ku Shilo, vandu va likabila la Dani vayendalili kuchifugamili chimong'omong'omo chechahongoliwi na Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Mlawi na avala waki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo kwavili lepi na nkosi wa ku Isilaeli, kwavili na Mlawi mwatamayi ngati myehe kutali ku mulima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu. Mundu mwenuyo amtolili mdala kuhuma ku Betelehemu ya Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Nambu avala amyomili Mlawi mwenuyo, akamleka na kuhamba kunyumba ya dadi waki ku Betelehemu, akatama kwa lukumbi lwa miyehi mcheche. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Ligono limonga mngana waki ahambili kumlanda, aganayi kumkulukisa muni amuwuyisa kunyumba yaki. Hinu mgosi mwenuyo akahamba pamonga na mtumisi waki na punda zivili. Ndi mdala yula akampeleka mgati kwa dadi waki, na mkohanu waki peamuweni akampokela kwa sangaluka. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Mkohanu waki amyupili asigalila, akatama nayu kwa magono gadatu, Mlawi mwenuyo na mtumisi waki vakalya na kunywa na kugona kwenuko. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Ligono la mcheche, vayimwiki lukela pee, vajitendekili kuwuka, nambu mkohanu waki akamjovela, “Mlya hoti chakulya chidogo muni muvya na makakala ndi muwukayi.”<verse eid="JDG 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Hinu vavili venavo vatamili, vakalya na kunywa pamonga. Kangi mkohanu waki akamjovela Mlawi, “Pepayi ugona penapa kilu iyi na kusangaluka.”<verse eid="JDG 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Mundu yula payimili na kugana kuwuka, mkohanu waki akakangamalisa asigalila, na mwene akagona mala ya pili kwenuko. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Ligono la muhanu ayimwiki lukela, na kugana kuwuka. Nambu mkohanu waki akamjovela, “Lyahi hoti chidogo, ulindila muhi ndi uwuka.” Ndi voha vavili vakalya pamonga.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Mlawi na avala yaki yula pamonga na mtumisi waki pavayimili kuhamba, mkohanu waki akamjovela Mlawi, “Hinu, lola lilanga litipimi. Ugona penapa na kusangaluka. Chilau lukela pee yati uyimuka na kutumbula lugendu lwaku lwa kuwuya kunyumba.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Nambu Mlawi yula akabela kugona kwenuko kilu yingi. Ndi, akayima na kuwuka akahika papipi na muji wa Yebusi ndi hinu ukemiwa Yelusalemu. Avili na avala waki na mvanda waki pamonga na punda zivili zila. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Pevahegalili ku Yebusi, na kilu yihegalili, mtumisi akamjovela bambu waki, “Hinu mbanga tiyingila mu muji uwu wa Vayebusi na tikagone mwenumo.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Bambu waki akamyangula, “Yati ting'anamuka lepi na kuyingila mumuji wa vayehe ndi vangavya Vaisilaeli. Yati tiyendelela na lugendu mbaka tihika ku Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Tikangamale tihamba tikagona ku Gibea amala ku Lama.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Hinu, vakayendelela na lugendu lwavi, lilanga latipimi pevavili papipi na muji wa Gibea weuvii mumlima wa likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Vakayingila pamuji wa Gibea muni vagona mwenumo. Pavayingili pamuji vakahamba kutama paluvanja lwa muji, muni kawaka mundu mweavagongolili vakagona kunyumba yaki.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Pavavili kwenuko gogo mmonga, abwelili kuhuma kumgunda waki. Gogo mwenuyo avili mkolonjinji wa mulima wa hitumbi ya Efulaimu na atamayi ku Gibea ngati myehe. Vandu va muji wa Gibea vavili vandu va likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Gogo yula pealolili na kumuwona mwanalugendu yula avi paluvanja, akamkota, “Uhumili kwoki na uhamba kwoki?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Na mwene akamyangula, “Tihumili ku Betelehemu ku mulima wa Yuda na tihamba kutali kuhitumbi ya Efulaimu. Kwenuko ndi kwenitama ndi hinu niwuya kulugendu ku Betelehemu kumulima wa Yuda na niwuya kunyumba ya Bambu. Nambu kawaka mundu yoyoha mweatigongolili munyumba yaki. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Tete vatumisi vaku tivi na manyahi ndava ya kulisila punda zitu. Mewawa tivi na libumunda na divayi, ndi vikunikola nene na mdala wangu na mtumisi wangu. Tigana lepi chindu chochoha.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Gogo yula akavajovela, “Mbwela kugona kwa nene na yati nikuvapela chindu chochoha nambu mkotoka kugona paluvanja.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Ndi akavapeleka kunyumba yaki na kuzipela punda manyahi. Vandu venavo vakasanja magendelu na vakalya na kunywa.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Pevavili mukulya na kusangaluka, vakabwela vagosi vahakau va muji wenuwo na kutindila nyumba yeniyo na kugonga pamlyangu. Vakamjovela gogo yula mkolo nyumba, “Muhumisa kuvala mgosi mweabwelili kwaku, tigana kugona naku.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Nambu gogo yula mkolo nyumba akahuma kuvala, akavajovela, “Lepi valongo vangu, pepayi mkotoka kumhengela lijambu lenili la soni. Mwenuyu ndi myehe wangu, mkotoka kumkitila uhakau wenuwo. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Mlola, nivi na msikana wangu mwangagona na mgosi mewa avi msikana wa mvanda wa myehe uyu. Nivahumisa na muvahengela ngati chamnogela, nambu mundu uyu mkotoka kumuhengela lijambu la soni.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Nambu vagosi vala vamuyuwanili lepi. Hinu Mlawi yula akamuhumisa kuvala mdala waki na kuvapela vandu venavo. Na vene vakagona nayu kwa makakala kilu yoha mbaka lukela. Hambakucha vakamleka ahamba.<verse eid="JDG 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Papipi na lukela, mdala yula akabwela mbaka pamlyangu wa nyumba yaavili mgosi waki, akagwa pahi na kuvya penapo mbaka lukela pakwachili njwee. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Mgosi wa mdala yula payimwiki lukela, akadindula milyangu ya nyumba, akahuma kuvala muni ayendelela na lugendu. Chigafula akamkolela mdala waki kuvala agonili pahi pamlyangu na mawoko gaki gavii ngati igana kukamula mulyangu. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Akamjovela, “Yima tihambe.” Nambu mwene ayangwili lepi chindu muni avii amali kufwa, akamyinula akamkweha panani ya punda waki na kumpeleka mbaka kunyumba yaki. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Pahikili kunyumba akatola chipula na kudumulana higa ya mdala yula hipandi kumi na vivili. Kangi akavipeleka vipandi vyenivyo mu kila likabila la Isilaeli, kila likabila lapewili chipandi chimonga. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Vandu voha vevalolili lijambu lenilo vakajova, “Lijambu lenilo la kukangasa lahumalili lepi amala kuwonekana kuhumila ligono lila Vaisilaeli pavahumili ku mulima wa Misili mbaka lelu. Tikotana na tiholalela na kuhamula cha kukita.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vakujitendeleha kwa ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Vandu voha va Isilaeli, kuhuma Dani mbaka ku Bel Sheba, pamonga na vala vevihuma ku mulima wa Gileadi, vandu voha vakonganike ku Mizipa, palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Vachilongosi voha va makabila ga Isilaeli vatami palongolo ya msambi ya vandu va Chapanga. Voha vevavii penapo ndi vavii manjolinjoli laki mcheche na vavi na mapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Vandu va likabila la Benjamini, vayuwini kuvya vandu vangi vala vakonganike ku Mizipa. Hinu Vaisilaeli vakamkota mgosi Mlawi yula. “Tijovela uhakau wenuwo wakitiki wuli.?”<verse eid="JDG 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Mlawi yula, mgosi wa avala mweakomiwi akavayangula, “Nene na mdala wangu tahikili Gibea, muji wa likabila la Bemjamini muni tigona kwenuko kilu yeniyo. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Nambu vandu va muji wa Gibea vakabwela kilu vayitindila nyumba yanagonili. Vagana kunikoma, vakamlimba avala wangu kwa makakala mbaka akafwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Nene nikatola higa yaki, nikadumulana hipandi hipandi na kupeleka chipandi chimonga chimonga mukila likabila la Isilaeli, muni vakitili lijambu la kuyomesa na la soni pa Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Hinu nyenye mwavoha ndi Mwavaizilaeli, mkotana na muwusa uhamula winu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Voha kwa pamonga vakayima na kujova, “Kawaka yoyoha pagati yitu mweiwuya kulindanda laki amala kunyumba yaki. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Chenichi ndi chetikita kuyivala Gibea: Yati tikina gudugudu namuna chetikuvatova. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Yati tihagula vandu kumi mu kila vandu miya yimonga ya makabila goha ga Vaisilaeli, vandu elufu yimonga mukila vandu elufu yimonga, vandu elufu yimonga mukila vandu elufu kumi. Venavo yati vivya na lihengu la kuvaletela chakulya manjolinjoli vevivya na lihengu la kuutova muji wa Gibea pamulima wa Benjamini kwa uhakau wevakitili ku Isilaeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Hinu vagosi voha va Isilaeli vevakonganiki pamonga vayidakilini, voha vakavya chindu chimonga na kuvatova vandu va muji wa Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Hinu vandu va makabila ga Isilaeli vakatuma vandu vahamba kumulima woha wa likabila la Benjamini, vakavakotayi, “Mwihotola wuli kukita uhakahu ngati uwu? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Hinu muvahumisa vandu avo vahakau njwee vevavi mu Gibea, muni tihotola kuvakoma na kuwusa uhakau uwu pa Isilaeli.” Nambu vandu va likabila la Benjamini vabelili kuvayuwanila valongo vavi Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Nambu vandu voha va likabila la Benjamini vakakonganeka kula Gibea kuhumila mumiji yavi, muni vakatovana na Vaisilaeli vayavi. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Vandu va likabila la Benjamini vavakemili manjolinjoli elufu ishilini na sita vavihotola kutovana, mewawa kwavili na manjolinjoli vakekesi miya saba kuhuma ku muji wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Pagati ya vandu venavo vevahaguliwi kwavili na vandu miya saba vevatumili chiwoko cha kumangeya, kila mmonga ahotwili kujugumila liganga kwa mbilanji na kulunga liyunju changali kubuda. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Vaisilaeli vavakemili manjolinjoli vangi laki mcheche kuhuma mu makabila gangi, vevihotola kutovana ngondo.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila ga Vaisilaeli gitovana ngondo na makabila la Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Vaisilaeli vahambili pandu pa kumfugamila Chapanga ku Beteli, Na kwenuko vakamukota Chapanga, “likakabila loki lelitumbula kuhamba kutovana na vandu va likabila la Benjamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Bambu Chapanga akavayangula “likabila la Yuda lihamba hoti.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Hinu, manjolinjoli va Isilaeli vakahamba lukela, vakagona pandu pakupumulila papipi na muji wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Vaisilaeli vakahuma na kuyima kila mmonga pandu paki ndava ya kutovana na manjolinjoli ga likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Manjolinjoli va likabila la Benjamini vakahuma kuvala ya muji wa Gibea vakavatova Vaisilaeli na ligono lenilo, vakavakoma vandu va Isilaeli elufu ishilini na zivili. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Hinu Vaisilaeli vakahamba kangi pandu pakumyupila Bambu Chapanga, vakamvembela Chapanga mbaka kimihi. Kangi vakamukota naha Chapanga, “Wu, yati tihamba kangi kutovana na valongo vitu, va likabila la Benjamini?” Bambu Chapanga akavayangula, “Muhamba mkatovana.” <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Hinu Vaisilaeli vakajikangamalisa, vakajitendekeha kangi kutovana na manjolinjoli ga likabila la Benjamini balapala pevajipangili pakutumbula. <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Hinu ligono lelagelekili Vaisilaeli vavi papipi kutovana na vandu va likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Ligono lenilo la pili vandu va likabila la Benjamini vahumili ku Gibea na kuvazangila Vaisilaeli, vavakomili Vaisilaeli elufu kumi na nane vahotwili kutovana bwina pangondo. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Manjolinjoli voha va Vaisilaeli vakahamba ku Beteli. Vatamili kwenuko palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga kuvembeneka na kujihinisa chakulya mbaka kimihi. Vamuwusili Bambu Chapanga luteta lwa kutinyiswa na teta za uteke. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Vaisilaeli vamuyupili Bambu Chapanga muni avajovela yati vikita kyani. Lukumbi lwenulo lisanduku la Lilaganu lavii ku Beteli kula. <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Fineasi mwana wa Eliazali, mjukulu wa Aluni ndi mweavii mteta mwealiyangalila lisanduku lenilo. Vaisilaeli vamkotili Bambu, “Wu, tihamba kangi kutovana na valongo vitu va likabila la Benjamini?” Bambu Chapanga akavayangula, “Muhamba chilau yati nikuvakita muvahotola.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Hinu, Vaisilaeli vakavavika manjolinjoli vavi cha kujihiha kuutindila muji wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Vaisilaeli vakahamba kutovana na vandu va likabila la Benjamini muligono la datu. Vakayima kila mundu pandu paki kuutindila muji wa Gibea ngati chavalongolili kukita pakutumbula. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Kangi manjolinjoli va likabila la Benjamini pavahumili kuvala kutovana na Vaisilaeli, na pavavili mukutovana na Vaisilaeli vakahuma kuvala ya muji wavi. Vavakomili Vaisilaeli vayavi munjila zezihamba miji ya Beteli na Gibea, vavakomili Vaisilaeli selasini. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Vandu va likabila la Benjamini vakajova, “Tivatovili ngati chatalongoli kuvatova.” Nambu Vaisilaeli vakajovelana, “Tete titila muni tivahuta kutali na muji mbaka kunjila yivaha.”<verse eid="JDG 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Hinu manjolinjoli goha ga Isilaeli gakawuka pandu penapo na kujitendekeha kangi ku Baali Tamali. Vala vevajifiyili vakawuka kanyata pandu pavi pevajihihili ku upandi wa kwalitipama lilanga wa muji wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Manjolinjoli vakekesi vevahaguliwi kuhuma makabila goha ga Isilaeli vavatovili vandu va muji wa Gibea. Ngondo ya ligono lenilo yavi yivaha. Nambu vandu va likabila la Benjamini vamanyili lepi kuvya kukomiwa kwavi kuvi papipi. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Bambu Chapanga avakitili Vaisilaeli vavahotola vandu va likabila la Benjamini. Vaisilaeli vavakomili vandu va likabila la Benjamini elufu ishilini na muhanu na miya yimonga ligono lenilo. Manjolinjoli venavo voha vevakomiwi ndi vevavi na uhotola wa kuhengela vindu vya ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Hinu vandu va likabila la Benjamini vakalola kuvya vahotwili lepi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JDG 20:36">Vaisilaeli vakuvahotola Vabenjamini</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Vaisilaeli vakawuya mumbele ngati vakuvatila manjolinjoli va likabila la Benjamini, muni vavaleka vala vevajifiyili papipi na ku Gibea vavatova Vabenjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Vandu vala vevajifiyili vakakita kanyata kuyingila mu Gibea na kuvakoma kwa upanga vandu voha vevavili mwenumo. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Vayidakilini na Vaisilaeli vangi vevajifiyili vala kuvya peviwona lyohi livaha likwela kunani kuhuma kumuji wenuwo, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />kangi vauzangila muji wenuwo. Lukumbi lwenulo vandu va likabila la Benjamini vamali kuvakoma vandu selasini va Isilaeli na kujovelana, “Tivatovili ngati pakutumbula.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Nambu ulangisu wa lyohi pawatumbwili kuhumila pamuji, vandu va likabila la Benjamini pavalolili mumbele yavi, vakakenyemuka kulola lyohi kunani na muji wavi uyaka motu. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Ndi Vaisilaeli vakang'anamuka, vandu va likabila la Benjamini vakavagaya muni hinu valolili kuvya kukomiwa kwavi kuvi papipi. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Hinu vakang'anamuka, kuvatila Vaisilaeli kuhamba kulukongolo, nambu ngondo yikavakolela, vakajikolela vavi pagati ya manjolinjoli ga Isilaeli na manjolinjoli ga Vaisilaeli vevahuma kumuji vakavatova na kuvakoma. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Vaisilaeli vakavatindila vandu va likabila la Benjamini, vakavavingisana kuhuma ku Noha mbaka kwelihumila lilanga mwa muji wa Gibea vakavakoma vandu vamahele neju. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Ligono lenilo vakomiwi manjolinjoli vakekesi elufu kumi na nane va likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Vandu vangi va likabila la Benjamini vang'anamwiki, vatilili kuhamba kulukongolo mbaka litalawu la Limoni. Vangi elufu muhanu vakomiwi kujila yikulu pavatilayi. Vaisilaeli vayendalili kuvavingisana vandu va likabila la Benjamini mbaka kumuji wa Gidomu na kwenuko vakavakoma vandu elufu zivili va likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Vandu voha va likabila la Benjamini vevakomiwi ligono lenilo vavi elufu ishilini na muhanu, manjolinjoli vakekesi vevahotola kutovana ngondo bwina.<verse eid="JDG 20:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Nambu manjolinjoli miya sita va likabila la Benjamini vahotwili kutilalila kulukongolo mbaka kulitalawu la Limoni, na vakatama kwenuko kwa miyehi mcheche. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Vaisilaeli vakavang'anamukila vandu vevasigalili va likabila la Benjamini, vakavakoma voha, vagosi na vadala na vana na mifuya yavi. Na miji yoha yavahikolili kwenuko vakahitinyisa motu.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Vadala ndava ya likabila la Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Vaisilaeli valapili ku Mizipa kuvya, Kawaka hati mmonga wavi mwakumleka msikana waki agegewa kwa vandu va likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Hinu Vaisilaeli vakahamba mbaka ku Beteli kuyupa palongolo ya Chapanga mbaka kimihi. Vakavemba kwa lwami luvaha na lipyanda. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Vakajova, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, ndava kyani lijambu lenili lihumalili kwa Vaisilaeli? Ndava kyani likabila limonga la Isilaeli liyagili.”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Chilau yaki vandu vayimwiki lukela pee, vakajenga pandu pakuwusila luteta, vakawusa luteta lwa kutinyisa na teta za uteke. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Kangi Vaisilaeli vakakotana, “Pagati ya makabila goha ga Isilaeli livi likabila loloha langabwela kumngonganu wewakitiwi palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga ku Mizipa?” Ndava muni vakitili chilapu kuvya mundu yoyoha mweangahamba palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga ku Mizipa iganikiwa akomewa. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Nambu Vaisilaeli vakavawonela lipyana valongo vavi va likabila la Benjamini, vakajova, “Lelu likabila limonga la Isilaeli liyongomiswi. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Hinu tikita wuli ndava ya vagosi va likabila la Benjamini vevasigalili muni vapata vadala? Ndava muni tamali kulapa kwa lihina la Bambu Chapanga kuvya yati tikuvapela lepi vasikana vitu vavya vadala vavi.”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Vakakotana kangi, “Chikundi choki cha likabila la Isilaeli chechangahamba kumngonganu petahambili kumuyupa Bambu Chapanga ku Mizipa?” Ndi vakamanya kuvya kawaka mundu yoyoha kuhuma ku Yabeshi Gileadi mwabwelili kumngonganu wenuwo. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Muni pevavalangiwi ku Mizipa, kwavili lepi na mundu yoyoha wa ku Yabeshi Giliadi mweavili pa mngonganu wenuwo. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Hinu kumngonganu wenuwo wa Isilaeli vakahamula kuvapeleka manjolinjoli vaki elufu kumi na mbili vevavili vakekesi neju na kuvalagiza, “Muhamba mukavakoma kwa mapanga vandu va ku Yabeshi Gileadi, kila mundu mweitama kwenuko mewa mukavakoma vadala pamonga na vana. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Yati mkuvakoma vagosi voha na vadala voha vangavya vakamwali.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Hinu ku Yabeshi Gileadi vakavakolela vasikana miya mcheche vevavi vakona vangagona na mgosi, vakavatola na vakavapeleka kukambi ya ku Shilo mu mulima wa Kanaani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Kangi mngonganu woha wa Vaisilaeli vapeliki ujumbi wa uteke kwa vandu va likabila la Benjamini vevatamayi ku litalawu la Limoni. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Vandu venavo va likabila la Benjamini vakawuya, vapewili vasikana vala vevahumili ku Yabeshi Giliadi vevangagona na mgosi vevalekiwi changakomiwa. Nambu vasikana venavo vavatosili lepi.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Mitima yikavavina Vaisilaeli, muni Bambu Chapanga avikili ligodi pagati ya makabila genago ga Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Kangi vachilongosi va mngonganu wula vakakota, “Hinu yati tikita wuli muni kuvapela vadala wenavo vagosi vevasigalili, muni vadala voha va likabila la benjamini vakomiwi? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Yiganikiwa vagosi vevasigalili va likabila la Benjamini vapewa vadala muni vayendeleza likabila lavi, na likotoka kuyaga likabila loloha pa Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Nambu tihotola lepi kuvagegesa vasikana vitu vavyai vadala vavi, muni tamali kulapa kuvya mundu yoyoha mwakumgegesa msikana waki kwa vagosi va likabila la Benjamini apewa likoto.”<verse eid="JDG 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Kangi vakajova, “Lola kuvii na mselebuko wa Bambu Chapanga weukitiwa kila mwaka ku Shilo uvii papipi.” Muji wenuwo wa Shilo uvii ku kasikazini ya Beteli na kusini mwa Lebona, mewa upandi wa kwelihumila lilanga kunjila yikulu yeyihuma ku Beteli kuhamba Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Hinu vakavalagiza vagosi vala likabila la Benjamini vevangapata vadala, “Muhamba mukajihiha mumigunda ya mizabibu. <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />Muvya mihu, vasikana va Shilo pevihuma kuvala kukina lukumbi lwa mselebuko, muhuma mumizabibu na kila mundu amtola kwa makakala msikana mmonga avya mdala waki. Kangi muwuya kumulima wa Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Vadadi vavi amala vahaja vavi vakabwela kutivembenekela yati tikuvajovela, ‘Tete tikuvayupa muvawonela lipyana vandu va likabila la Benjamini na muvalekela vavatola vasikana venavo, muni tahotwili lepi kuvapela vadala kungondo ya Yabeshi Gileadi. Mewawa nyenye mwavagegisi lepi vasikana venavo kwitu, ndi yati muhamuliwa lepi.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Vala vagosi va likabila la Benjamini vakakita chenicho, kila mmonga ajihagulili msikana pagati ya vasikana vevahumili kukina kuvala na kumtola avya mdala waki. Kangi vakawuya ku mulila wevapewili, vakajenga miji yavi kangi na kutama mwenumo. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Lukumbi lulolo Vaisilaeli vangi vakawuka, kila mundu akawuya kulikabila laki na kwa valongo vaki. Kila mundu awuyili kupandu paki peapewili.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Magono genago Vaisilaeli vavili lepi na nkosi. Kila mundu akitili ngati chealolili mwene kuvya chabwina.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>